Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.73,0:01:44.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Noriko SENGOKU Akira TANI
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.42,0:02:57.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}导演：黑泽明
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.42,0:02:57.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Directed by Akira KUROSAWA
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.80,0:03:03.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}战国时代：内战不休
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.80,0:03:03.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The warring states period: ongoing civil war
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.93,0:03:08.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盗贼成群，四处劫掠
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.93,0:03:08.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}has given rise to hordes of marauding bandits
Dialogue: 2,0:03:08.19,0:03:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马蹄如雷，吓得百姓胆寒
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.19,0:03:11.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The thunder of hooves terrorizes the meek
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.44,0:03:15.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这样的时代……
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.44,0:03:15.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}In such times. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.78,0:03:59.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该去抢了！那个村子也抢？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.78,0:03:59.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to raid! That village too?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.54,0:04:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！去年秋天才抢过他们的米！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.54,0:04:07.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait! We snatched their rice only last autumn!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.42,0:04:11.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在去，他们什么都不会剩！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.42,0:04:11.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If we go now, they'll have nothing!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:11.67,0:04:16.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！等他们大麦熟了，再来！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.67,0:04:16.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine! When their barley's ripe, we'll come back!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.66,0:04:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}神明抛弃我们了！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.66,0:04:51.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The gods have forsaken us!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.29,0:04:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}地租！劳役！战争！旱灾！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.29,0:04:58.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Land tax! Forced labor! War! Drought!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更糟的是，还有盗贼！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And to make it worse, bandits!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.89,0:05:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}神明就是要我们农民死！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.89,0:05:10.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The gods want us peasants to die!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.56,0:05:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说得对！还不如死了！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.56,0:05:13.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's right! We're better off dead!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:14.90,0:05:19.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你自己想死吧。抱怨有什么用。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.90,0:05:19.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Speak for yourself. Whining won't do us any good.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.78,0:05:22.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找官老爷！我们交了不少税。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.78,0:05:22.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The magistrate! We pay plenty of tax.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.82,0:05:25.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-让他帮忙！  -没用的。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.82,0:05:25.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get him to help!   -It's no use.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.70,0:05:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会等盗贼来了，再来查看我们烧毁的村子！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.70,0:05:30.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll wait until bandits come, then inspect our burning ruins!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:30.83,0:05:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！他根本不会帮忙！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.83,0:05:33.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! He won't help at all!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.54,0:05:36.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就只剩一个办法！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.54,0:05:36.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That leaves us one choice!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:36.21,0:05:41.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把米和大麦都交给盗贼，然后上吊！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.21,0:05:41.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Give the bandits all our rice and barley, then hang ourselves!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.97,0:05:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样官府就会震怒，派人来了！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.97,0:05:45.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That'll shock the magistrate into coming!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们杀了盗贼。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll kill the bandits.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.73,0:06:02.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全杀光！一个也别放回去。全杀光！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.73,0:06:02.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill 'em all! So none come back.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我不想干！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I-Idon'twanna!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不到……
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't do that. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不可能。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That'd be impossible.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}落魄武士我们敢杀，盗贼就不敢？！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We can kill fallen samurai, but not bandits? !
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.88,0:06:22.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别吵了！没工夫内讧！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.88,0:06:22.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Quit it! Ain't no time for infighting!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.34,0:06:28.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哼。我们根本打不过盗贼。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.34,0:06:28.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh. We ain't got no chance of beating bandits.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:28.26,0:06:33.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}输了怎么办？我们都会死，连肚子里的孩子也活不了！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.26,0:06:33.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What if we lose? We'll all die. Even babies in the womb!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.23,0:06:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受够了！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.23,0:06:34.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sick of this!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:34.90,0:06:40.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与其提心吊胆活着，不如去杀人，或者被杀！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.90,0:06:40.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Instead of living in fear, I'd rather kill, or be killed!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.53,0:06:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们农民只能忍。弱者就得听强者的。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.53,0:06:46.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Us peasants can only persevere. The weak must obey the mighty.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.49,0:06:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不对盗贼动手。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.49,0:06:51.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll do nothing to the bandits.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.16,0:06:54.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把大麦给他们。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.16,0:06:54.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll give them our barley.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.79,0:06:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求他们给我们留够活命的。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.79,0:06:59.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And we'll ask them to leave us enough to live off.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:59.79,0:07:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只能这样，哪怕跪在泥里磕头。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.79,0:07:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all we can do, even if we gotta bow our heads in the dirt.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会可怜我们？！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll show us mercy? !
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.26,0:07:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忘了吗？！为了现在吃的米，我们付出了什么……
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.26,0:07:14.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you forgotten? ! What we gave for the rice we eat now. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:07:35.83,0:07:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去找长老！让长老来决定！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.83,0:07:40.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go see the elder! We'll get the elder to decide!
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈判得讲诚意。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bargaining needs good faith.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.70,0:08:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给狼一条腿，它下一步就要你的胳膊。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.70,0:08:53.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Give a wolf your leg, and he'll want your arm next.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.08,0:08:56.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}秋天他们还会来。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.08,0:08:56.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll be back again in autumn.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.08,0:09:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-输了怎么办？  -我们已经输了！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.08,0:09:00.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What if we lose?   -We've already lost!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没了大麦，我们就没命了！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We lose our barley, we lose our lives!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}必须这么干。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It must be done.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:11.93,0:09:15.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长老，太冒险了。我们是农民。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.93,0:09:15.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Elder, it's too risky. We're peasants.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们打不了仗！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't fight!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:17.10,0:09:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得雇武士。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.10,0:09:19.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We must hire samurai.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:19.68,0:09:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！农民雇武士？闻所未闻！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.68,0:09:24.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? ! Peasants hiring samurai? That's unheard of!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:24.19,0:09:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我亲眼见过。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.19,0:09:28.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I have seen it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:29.49,0:09:34.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们出生的村子被烧成灰的时候。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.49,0:09:34.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}When the village you were born in was burned to the ground.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.74,0:09:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们逃到这块地方时，我看见了。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.74,0:09:39.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw it when we fled to this land.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一个村子没被烧。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}One village did not burn.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:43.75,0:09:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唯一雇了武士的村子。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.75,0:09:47.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The only one that hired samurai.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.25,0:09:50.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是长老，村子跟村子不一样。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.25,0:09:50.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But Elder, villages are different.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:50.88,0:09:54.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们也不同。我们连粥都给武士喝不起！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.88,0:09:54.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}As are we. We can't feed gruel to samurai!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:54.26,0:09:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们吃小米！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.26,0:09:56.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll eat millet!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.51,0:10:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪个武士会只为吃饭卖命？啊？！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.51,0:10:00.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What samurai would fight for food alone? Huh? !
Dialogue: 2,0:10:00.72,0:10:02.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}武士太要面子。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.72,0:10:02.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Samurai are too proud.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.23,0:10:08.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去找饿肚子的武士。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.23,0:10:08.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Find samurai with empty bellies.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.28,0:10:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肚子一饿，连熊都会下山。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.28,0:10:16.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}An empty belly makes even a bear descend a mountain.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.53,0:11:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}岂有此理！你敢羞辱我！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.53,0:11:02.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What an insult! How dare you!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.20,0:11:07.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放肆的农民！我再落魄，也是武士！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.20,0:11:07.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Impudent peasant! I am lowly, but still a samurai!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:07.46,0:11:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收起你们的臭施舍！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.46,0:11:09.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your damned charity!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:12.59,0:11:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蠢货！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.59,0:11:13.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Imbecile!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我警告过你。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I warned you.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:55.01,0:11:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，这大麦熟了。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.01,0:11:57.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, this barley has ripened.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.34,0:12:01.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们离开十天了。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.34,0:12:01.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we've been away days.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.22,0:12:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么办？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.22,0:12:02.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What should we do?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.77,0:12:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不对。这里熟得早。不是我们山上的大麦！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.77,0:12:09.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. It ripened early here. It's not our mountain barley!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们全身都湿透了！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We're drenched to the bone!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:15.78,0:12:19.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，找到武士了吗？又便宜、又厉害、又疯的？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.78,0:12:19.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, found samurai yet? Cheap, strong, and loony?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:58.70,0:13:01.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些是剩的。便宜卖你。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.70,0:13:01.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}These are leftover. I'll sell them cheap.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:01.95,0:13:03.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是笑话！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.95,0:13:03.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What a joke!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.70,0:13:07.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-有什么好笑的？  -他是个瞎子！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.70,0:13:07.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's so funny?   -He's blind!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:08.58,0:13:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要买吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.58,0:13:09.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you buy them?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.08,0:13:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不买那些包子。  -我宁愿吃马粪。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.08,0:13:13.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Not those buns.   -I'd rather eat horse crap.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:18.09,0:13:19.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他身无分文！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.09,0:13:19.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He's flat broke!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:19.84,0:13:22.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚赌钱输光了。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.84,0:13:22.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Gambled away his money last night.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:22.47,0:13:26.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他挥剑发火，我们三个揍了他。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.47,0:13:26.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Waved his sword angrily, so three of us beat him.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.60,0:13:28.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把他鼻子打出血了。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.60,0:13:28.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We bloodied his nose.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.19,0:13:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别费心了。他们只吃小米。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.19,0:13:36.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't bother. They'll only eat millet.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:36.82,0:13:42.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？那可不行！吃不好会得夜盲症的。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.82,0:13:42.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? That's no good! Eat well or you'll go night-blind.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.99,0:13:48.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还剩四个。换一杯米。就一杯。怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.99,0:13:48.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got four left. For one cup of rice. Just one. Well?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:52.50,0:13:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可恶！一群小气鬼！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.50,0:13:55.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dammit! Bunch of cheapskates!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:13.77,0:14:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的努力全白费了。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.77,0:14:16.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our efforts were all for nothing.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:17.02,0:14:21.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是还有米，我们都能买四十个包子了。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.02,0:14:21.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If we still had our rice, we could've bought buns.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我说得没错吧？！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But, I'm right, ain't I? !
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.87,0:14:29.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那乡巴佬生气了！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.87,0:14:29.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That yokel's angry!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:30.54,0:14:32.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有意思！继续啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.54,0:14:32.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Funny stuff! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:37.54,0:14:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天底下找不出比我们更傻的了。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.54,0:14:42.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You won't find bigger suckers than us anywhere.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.92,0:14:50.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们请他吃饭。请他喝酒。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.92,0:14:50.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We treated him to food. We treated him to booze.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.81,0:14:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果还被他揍了一顿。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.81,0:14:54.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then we got beaten by him.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.56,0:15:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那浪人是个真汉子！不像某个装睡的胆小鬼。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.56,0:15:00.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That ronin was a real man! Unlike some coward faking sleep.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.07,0:15:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。我们该走了。该回家了。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.07,0:15:06.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. We oughta go. We oughta go home.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.66,0:15:09.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！这家伙哭了！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.66,0:15:09.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ha! This guy's crying!
Dialogue: 2,0:15:09.95,0:15:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他想老婆了。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.95,0:15:11.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He misses his wife.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.83,0:15:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒想花钱看他跟老婆睡觉！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.83,0:15:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd pay to see him sleep with his wife!
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.16,0:15:19.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。我们得赶紧回村。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.16,0:15:19.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. We oughta go back to the village quick.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:19.79,0:15:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走，走！连包子都买不起？别想请武士了！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.79,0:15:23.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, go! Can't afford buns? Forget samurai!
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.84,0:15:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说到底，我们农民分得清好种坏种，
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.84,0:15:28.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}After all, us peasants can tell a good seed from a bad seed,
Dialogue: 2,0:15:28.47,0:15:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却分不清好武士坏武士。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.47,0:15:31.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but not a good samurai from a bad'un.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.93,0:15:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，厉害的我们也管不住，
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.93,0:15:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Plus, we can't keep a strong one in check,
Dialogue: 2,0:15:38.35,0:15:44.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯接受我们的，多半也是没本事的。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.35,0:15:44.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and if any accept our offer, they'll probably be weak.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:51.87,0:15:57.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚我饿昏了头，行事鲁莽……
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.87,0:15:57.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Last night, I acted rashly out of sheer hunger. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:15:58.00,0:16:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骗子！你有钱赌博！滚出去！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.00,0:16:01.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Liar! You had money to gamble! Get outta here!
Dialogue: 2,0:16:02.75,0:16:05.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？想打架吗？！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.75,0:16:05.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh yeah? Wanna fight? !
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.51,0:16:09.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打架了，打架了！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.51,0:16:09.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A fight, a fight!
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.64,0:16:15.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，这边！快醒醒！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.64,0:16:15.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, over here! Wake up already!
Dialogue: 2,0:16:25.36,0:16:28.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}秃子！别弹那丧气的调子了！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.36,0:16:28.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Baldie! Quit that gloomy tune!
Dialogue: 2,0:16:28.99,0:16:32.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，大爷，继续弹！我们支持你！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.99,0:16:32.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nah Gramps, keep strumming! We're with ya!
Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.52,0:17:00.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.52,0:17:00.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn you!
Dialogue: 2,0:17:03.27,0:17:04.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.27,0:17:04.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi!
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.65,0:17:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手，万造！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.65,0:17:07.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop, Manzo!
Dialogue: 2,0:17:07.73,0:17:10.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想回家吗，你这蠢货？！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.73,0:17:10.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna go home, you moron? !
Dialogue: 2,0:17:11.66,0:17:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想，但不是去跟山贼讨价还价！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.66,0:17:14.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I do, but not to bargain with bandits!
Dialogue: 2,0:17:15.37,0:17:20.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请不到武士，除了讨价还价还能怎么办？！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.37,0:17:20.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If we can't hire samurai, what else can we do but bargain? !
Dialogue: 2,0:17:21.67,0:17:24.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！我知道了！可你听好了！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.67,0:17:24.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine! Got it! But get this!
Dialogue: 2,0:17:32.88,0:17:37.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听好了。就算跟山贼讨价还价，
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.88,0:17:37.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get this. Even if we bargain with bandits,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.02,0:17:43.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今年我们能给什么？拿你女儿怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.02,0:17:43.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}what can we give them this year? How about your daughter?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:43.94,0:17:47.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。你家志乃可是个美人！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.94,0:17:47.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Your Shino's a beauty!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:21.04,0:19:26.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个贼躲在那仓库里。混乱中让他跑了。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.04,0:19:26.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A thief's in that storehouse. He got away in a commotion.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:48.31,0:19:50.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几个贼？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.31,0:19:50.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How many thieves?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:50.69,0:19:52.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说就一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.69,0:19:52.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just one, I hear.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:52.27,0:19:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一个？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.27,0:19:53.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just one?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:55.19,0:19:57.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓一个人要这么多人？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.19,0:19:57.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So many people to catch just one?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:58.07,0:20:02.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们动不了。他挟持了个男孩当人质。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.07,0:20:02.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't make a move. He's holding a boy hostage.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:03.20,0:20:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一动手他就杀了那孩子。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.20,0:20:06.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll kill him if we attack.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.96,0:20:09.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听。你能听见他。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.96,0:20:09.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen. You can hear him.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:15.09,0:20:19.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可怜的孩子……那贼夜里闯进去，
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.09,0:20:19.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That poor child. . . The thief broke in at night,
Dialogue: 2,0:20:19.72,0:20:23.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那孩子已经哭了一整天了。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.72,0:20:23.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and the boy's been crying like that for a day.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:24.10,0:20:26.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他……嗓子都要哭哑了。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.10,0:20:26.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll. . . lose his voice.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:30.56,0:20:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他才七岁。想想他那可怜的父母……
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.56,0:20:34.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He's seven. To think of his poor parents. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:20:34.86,0:20:38.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那武士为什么要剃头？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.86,0:20:38.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why's that samurai getting his head shaved?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:38.74,0:20:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道。我求他帮忙，他答应了，还说：
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.74,0:20:43.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. I asked him to help, and he agreed and said,
Dialogue: 2,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“做两个饭团。”
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"Make two rice balls. "
Dialogue: 2,0:20:45.24,0:20:47.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他拉住一个路过的和尚，
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.24,0:20:47.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He grabbed a passing monk,
Dialogue: 2,0:20:47.50,0:20:51.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要人家给他剃头，还要了袈裟。真怪。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.50,0:20:51.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and asked for a head shave and his stole. Odd.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.97,0:22:27.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别过来！再靠近我就杀了这孩子！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.97,0:22:27.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back! Come any closer and the kid dies!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.06,0:22:29.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是和尚。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.06,0:22:29.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I am a monk.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.10,0:22:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别过来！别过来！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.10,0:22:32.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:34.31,0:22:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是和尚。我不会抓你。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.31,0:22:37.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Iam a monk. I shall not apprehend you.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.94,0:22:40.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别过来！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.94,0:22:40.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:40.86,0:22:42.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别过来！别过来！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.86,0:22:42.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.20,0:22:48.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会靠近你。可那孩子一定饿了。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.20,0:22:48.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I shall not approach you. But the child must be hungry.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:48.99,0:22:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！退后退后退后！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.99,0:22:51.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back! Back back back!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.37,0:22:59.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我带了饭团。你自己得吃一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.37,0:22:59.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I have brought rice balls. You must eat one yourself.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:02.26,0:23:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。你不吃吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.26,0:23:04.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here. Will you not eat?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:05.09,0:23:07.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么？为什么不吃？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.09,0:23:07.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well? Why not?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.14,0:23:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扔过来！
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.14,0:23:12.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Throw'em!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.60,0:23:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.60,0:23:14.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.77,0:23:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.77,0:23:16.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:42.38,0:23:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的儿子！我的儿子！
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.38,0:23:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My son!
Dialogue: 2,0:24:08.91,0:24:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的儿子！
Dialogue: 1,0:24:08.91,0:24:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My son!
Dialogue: 2,0:24:56.20,0:24:58.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要他。你得答应。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:56.20,0:24:58.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We need him. You must agree.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:59.12,0:25:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到镇上之前问他。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:59.12,0:25:01.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ask him before we reach town.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:18.22,0:25:19.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:25:18.22,0:25:19.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:28.78,0:25:32.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是冈本胜四郎！请收我为徒！
Dialogue: 1,0:25:28.78,0:25:32.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I am Okamoto Katsushiro! Please let me be your pupil!
Dialogue: 2,0:25:35.41,0:25:40.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“徒弟”？我是岛田勘兵卫，一个明摆着的浪人。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.41,0:25:40.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"Pupil"? I am Shimada Kanbei, a ronin of obvious status.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:41.54,0:25:43.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有徒弟。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:41.54,0:25:43.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I have no pupils.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:43.92,0:25:46.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起来。跪着没法说话。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:43.92,0:25:46.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get up. Can't talk on your knees.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:46.75,0:25:50.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生！求您了！收我做徒弟吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:25:46.75,0:25:50.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir! I beg you! Make me your apprentice!
Dialogue: 2,0:25:50.17,0:25:54.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起来吧。我们边走边听你说。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:50.17,0:25:54.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get up now. I shall listen as we walk.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:07.44,0:26:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀。看来你高估我了。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:07.44,0:26:12.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh dear. It would seem that you overestimate me.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:12.45,0:26:14.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，先生！  -听着。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:12.45,0:26:14.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-No sir!   -Now listen.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:15.32,0:26:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没什么特别的。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.32,0:26:18.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There is nothing special about me.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:18.79,0:26:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我或许有打仗的经验，但都是败仗。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:18.79,0:26:25.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I may have experience in battle, but only losing ones.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:25.42,0:26:31.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，我就是这样。别跟着我这么倒霉的人。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:25.42,0:26:31.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, that is all I am. You should not follow a man as unlucky as I.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:31.46,0:26:36.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，先生，我心意已决。就算您拒绝，我也要跟着您。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:31.46,0:26:36.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No sir, my mind is made up. I shall follow, even if you refuse.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:36.60,0:26:37.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拒绝。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:36.60,0:26:37.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Irefuse.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:39.47,0:26:42.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不值得别人追随。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:39.47,0:26:42.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Iam not worthy of a following.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:54.82,0:26:56.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有何贵干？
Dialogue: 1,0:26:54.82,0:26:56.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:04.62,0:27:06.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有何贵干？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:04.62,0:27:06.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:14.38,0:27:15.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放肆！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:14.38,0:27:15.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Insolence!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:17.39,0:27:19.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚开，小崽子。
Dialogue: 1,0:27:17.39,0:27:19.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Back off, little chicken.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:22.64,0:27:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大人，您是武士吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.64,0:27:24.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you a samurai, sir?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:28.73,0:27:30.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}废话！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:28.73,0:27:30.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn right!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:33.53,0:27:34.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:33.53,0:27:34.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:41.16,0:27:42.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去你的！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.16,0:27:42.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}To hell with you!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:00.76,0:28:02.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那人是谁？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:00.76,0:28:02.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is that man?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:08.56,0:28:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别管他。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.56,0:28:09.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave him be.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:28.58,0:28:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我一言！
Dialogue: 1,0:28:28.58,0:28:30.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hear my plea!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:32.34,0:28:35.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，笨蛋。怎么不回家去？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:32.34,0:28:35.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey dummy. Why don't you go home?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:37.72,0:28:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是个傻子。又把吃的送人了？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:37.72,0:28:41.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What a chump. Giving away food again?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:46.60,0:28:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可不行。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:46.60,0:28:48.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:48.60,0:28:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}师父！我会给农民发竹枪。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:48.60,0:28:52.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Master! I would arm the peasants with bamboo spears.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:52.73,0:28:55.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我想清楚了。  -可是师父……
Dialogue: 1,0:28:52.73,0:28:55.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I've thought it through.   -But Master. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:28:59.24,0:29:01.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不是闹着玩的。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:59.24,0:29:01.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is no game of soldiers.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:05.08,0:29:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们虽是山贼，可有四十人。两三个武士不够。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:05.08,0:29:11.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They may be bandits, but there are 40. Two or three samurai wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:25.26,0:29:28.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}防守比进攻更难。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:25.26,0:29:28.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Defense is harder than offense.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:30.39,0:29:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}背后有山？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:30.39,0:29:32.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A mountain is behind you?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:33.86,0:29:36.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马能翻过去吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.86,0:29:36.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can horses cross it?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:45.91,0:29:47.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前面是稻田。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:45.91,0:29:47.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rice fields in front.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:48.29,0:29:53.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}田里灌满水之前，容易遭骑兵突袭。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:48.29,0:29:53.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Until they're filled with water, you're open to a mounted attack.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:55.67,0:29:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个方向四个武士。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:55.67,0:29:58.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Four samurai for each direction.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.30,0:30:02.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两个作后卫。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:00.30,0:30:02.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Two as a rear guard.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:04.18,0:30:09.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少算上我，得七个人……
Dialogue: 1,0:30:04.18,0:30:09.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}At the very least, including myself, you would need seven. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:30:12.39,0:30:14.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}七个也许凑得齐。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:12.39,0:30:14.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Seven might be possible.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:14.90,0:30:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们长老说四个。对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:14.90,0:30:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our elder said four. Right?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:17.57,0:30:19.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再多三个也一样。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:17.57,0:30:19.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Three more's all the same.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:19.94,0:30:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别急。我还没答应。我只是假设。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:19.94,0:30:25.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Steady on. I haven't accepted. I'm talking hypothetically.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:26.45,0:30:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最要紧的是，找可靠的武士可不容易。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.45,0:30:31.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Most of all, finding reliable samurai won't be easy.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:31.83,0:30:36.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其你们只管饭。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:31.83,0:30:36.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Especially if you only intend to feed them.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:38.09,0:30:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有怪人才会接这活儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:38.09,0:30:41.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Only eccentrics would take the job.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:41.92,0:30:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，我已经厌倦打仗了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:41.92,0:30:46.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's more, I've grown tired of war.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:47.72,0:30:49.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太老了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:47.72,0:30:49.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm too old.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:10.62,0:31:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好险，幸亏我没生为农民。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.62,0:31:13.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh boy, glad I wasn't born a peasant.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:15.50,0:31:18.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，狗都过得比他们好。真是的。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:15.50,0:31:18.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, a dog's better off. Doggone it.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:19.38,0:31:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去死吧！上吊算了！一了百了！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:19.38,0:31:23.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Die, dammit! Hang yourselves! That'll solve it!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:23.51,0:31:25.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混账！闭嘴！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.51,0:31:25.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Swine! Be silent!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:25.13,0:31:27.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我只是说了实话。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:25.13,0:31:27.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? I only spoke the truth.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:27.84,0:31:32.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂什么？！你就没有一点同情心吗？！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:27.84,0:31:32.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How would you know? ! Have you no sympathy? !
Dialogue: 2,0:31:32.26,0:31:35.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别逗我笑！你才没同情心！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:32.26,0:31:35.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't make me laugh! You got no sympathy!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:35.89,0:31:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:35.89,0:31:36.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:37.02,0:31:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说错了吗？那你去帮他们啊！少说废话。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:37.02,0:31:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I wrong? Then you help 'em! Cut the bullcrap.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:46.03,0:31:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想打架？
Dialogue: 1,0:31:46.03,0:31:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wanna fight?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:50.12,0:31:52.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！停下！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:50.12,0:31:52.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Cease this! Stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:54.29,0:31:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下，停下！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:54.29,0:31:55.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop, stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:57.25,0:31:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:57.25,0:31:58.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Cease this!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:06.80,0:32:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，武士。看看这个。这吃的给你们！
Dialogue: 1,0:32:06.80,0:32:12.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, samurai. Check this out. This food's for you guys!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:12.39,0:32:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你知道这些乡巴佬吃什么吗？小米。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:12.39,0:32:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But do you know what these yokels eat? Millet.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:16.68,0:32:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们吃小米，却给你们白米饭！
Dialogue: 1,0:32:16.68,0:32:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They eat millet, and feed you white rice!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:20.81,0:32:24.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这已是他们能拿出的最好的了！少废话！
Dialogue: 1,0:32:20.81,0:32:24.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the best they can do! Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:26.28,0:32:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了好了。别嚷了。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:26.28,0:32:29.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Alright, fine. Enough yelling.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:34.70,0:32:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这饭我不能浪费。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:34.70,0:32:38.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I shall not let this rice go to waste.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:51.72,0:32:54.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！喂！
Dialogue: 1,0:32:51.72,0:32:54.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:56.48,0:32:58.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的人回来了！
Dialogue: 1,0:32:56.48,0:32:58.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our men are back!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:58.56,0:33:00.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！我们的人回来了！
Dialogue: 1,0:32:58.56,0:33:00.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Our men are back!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:13.07,0:33:14.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉和与平？
Dialogue: 1,0:33:13.07,0:33:14.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi and Yohei?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:14.87,0:33:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们留下找更多武士了。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:14.87,0:33:17.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They stayed to find more samurai.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:17.70,0:33:19.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}武士会来吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:33:17.70,0:33:19.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Will samurai come?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:19.33,0:33:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会来！七个。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:19.33,0:33:21.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They will! Seven of them.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:21.37,0:33:22.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}七个？！
Dialogue: 1,0:33:21.37,0:33:22.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Seven?!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:26.76,0:33:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}七个啊……
Dialogue: 1,0:33:26.76,0:33:28.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Seven, you Say. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:33:28.96,0:33:33.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长老，你说四个，我还反对来着……
Dialogue: 1,0:33:28.96,0:33:33.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Elder, you said four, so I objected, but. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:33:34.72,0:33:39.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我以为你能找来十个。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:34.72,0:33:39.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I was expecting you to get 10.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:40.02,0:33:45.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我要是说十个，你就会弄来十五个。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:40.02,0:33:45.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But if I'd asked for 10, you would've gotten 15.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:46.15,0:33:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}世事就是这样。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:46.15,0:33:48.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's how things go.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:50.11,0:33:53.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长老，我很担心。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:50.11,0:33:53.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Elder, I am mighty worried.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:57.91,0:34:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们村里的姑娘都觉得武士了不起。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:57.91,0:34:01.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our young women think samurai are wonderful.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:01.66,0:34:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是武士拐走我们的姑娘，就出乱子了。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:01.66,0:34:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If samurai take our young women, there'll be trouble.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:09.63,0:34:12.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山贼肯定会来。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:09.63,0:34:12.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bandits will surely come.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:13.68,0:34:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脑袋都要掉了，还操心胡子，只有傻子才这样。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:13.68,0:34:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Only a fool worries about his beard when he's about to lose his head.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:29.32,0:34:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}武士先生！
Dialogue: 1,0:34:29.32,0:34:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mister samurai!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:41.50,0:34:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么？要我过去？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:41.50,0:34:44.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? You want me to come?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:45.75,0:34:47.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟谁打？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:45.75,0:34:47.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}To fight whom?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:48.50,0:34:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:48.50,0:34:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:02.14,0:35:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备伏击他。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:02.14,0:35:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Prepare to ambush him.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:06.65,0:35:08.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一进来就动手。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:06.65,0:35:08.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Attack when he enters.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:13.86,0:35:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他来了。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:13.86,0:35:15.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He'scoming.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:16.16,0:35:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接招。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:16.16,0:35:17.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take it.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:20.16,0:35:22.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全力一击。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:20.16,0:35:22.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Strike with all your might.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:52.32,0:35:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂亮！
Dialogue: 1,0:35:52.32,0:35:53.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Superb!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:54.90,0:35:56.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实在抱歉。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:54.90,0:35:56.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My sincere apologies.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:57.03,0:36:01.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在下岛田勘兵卫。为一项任务寻访能人。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:57.03,0:36:01.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I am Shimada Kanbei. I seek skilled men for a mission.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:01.83,0:36:04.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情紧急。失礼了。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:01.83,0:36:04.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Urgently. We beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:05.70,0:36:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我个解释！
Dialogue: 1,0:36:05.70,0:36:06.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Explain yourself!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:07.71,0:36:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则我要讨个说法！
Dialogue: 1,0:36:07.71,0:36:09.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Or I demand satisfaction!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:10.08,0:36:14.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请息怒。我只是想先试试你的身手。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:10.08,0:36:14.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, be calm. I wished to test your mettle first.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:14.84,0:36:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上就要跟山贼打一仗。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:14.84,0:36:18.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A battle against bandits is imminent.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:20.59,0:36:21.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为哪一家？
Dialogue: 1,0:36:20.59,0:36:21.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}For which clan?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:22.10,0:36:27.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说来有些难堪，是为走投无路的农民。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:22.10,0:36:27.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, this is slightly awkward, but it's for desperate peasants.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:27.60,0:36:29.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-农民？！  -正是。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:27.60,0:36:29.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Peasants?!   -Indeed.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:29.48,0:36:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}报酬既无名也无利。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:29.48,0:36:32.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The reward is neither glory nor wealth.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:33.48,0:36:37.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们只能管饭，直到打完。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:33.48,0:36:37.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All they can offer is food for the duration.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:37.49,0:36:38.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荒唐！
Dialogue: 1,0:36:37.49,0:36:38.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:39.82,0:36:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要的是更高的报酬！
Dialogue: 1,0:36:39.82,0:36:42.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I seek greater recompense!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:43.49,0:36:45.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真遗憾。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:43.49,0:36:45.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How disappointing.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:46.45,0:36:48.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不再考虑一下？
Dialogue: 1,0:36:46.45,0:36:48.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you not reconsider?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:48.75,0:36:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝不考虑！
Dialogue: 1,0:36:48.75,0:36:50.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I will not!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:56.46,0:37:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}师父。失去他真可惜。多好的剑客。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:56.46,0:37:01.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Master. What a shame to lose him. Such a fine swordsman.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:47.68,0:37:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,0:37:47.68,0:37:49.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What'swrong?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:49.43,0:37:53.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个武士靠得住，可另外六个呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:37:49.43,0:37:53.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That samurai is reliable, but will the other six be?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:54.02,0:37:58.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别瞎操心了。等他们来了才知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:54.02,0:37:58.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop worrying already. We won't know till they turn up.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:58.57,0:38:00.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到那时候再操心也不迟。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:58.57,0:38:00.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then it'll be time to worry.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:16.29,0:38:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是那位大人。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:16.29,0:38:17.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That gentleman.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:36.48,0:38:38.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰了，武士老爷。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:36.48,0:38:38.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, mister samurai.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:41.07,0:38:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又来偷袭吗，大人？
Dialogue: 1,0:38:41.07,0:38:42.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Another ambush, sir?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:46.24,0:38:49.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正好，给你练练手。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:46.24,0:38:49.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it will be good training for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:21.65,0:39:23.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:21.65,0:39:23.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Very amusing.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:24.36,0:39:25.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请恕我们无礼。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:24.36,0:39:25.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please forgive us.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:41.30,0:39:42.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我干。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:41.30,0:39:42.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:45.26,0:39:50.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你瞧……我懂农民的苦。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:45.26,0:39:50.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You see. . . I understand the peasants' plight.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:51.05,0:39:55.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我明白你为什么要帮他们了。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:51.05,0:39:55.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I understand why you try to help them.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:55.81,0:40:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但真正让我心服的，是您的气度，大人。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.81,0:40:00.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But what truly convinced me was your charisma, sir.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:01.65,0:40:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋友还真是在想不到的地方冒出来。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:01.65,0:40:06.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Friends sure do appear in the darnedest places.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:11.95,0:40:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 1,0:40:11.95,0:40:13.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is your name?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:13.58,0:40:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}片山五郎兵卫。至少听着挺威风。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.58,0:40:16.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katayama Gorobei. Sounds strong, at least.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:27.97,0:40:31.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平！你在哪儿？快去淘米！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.97,0:40:31.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yohei! Where are you? Wash the rice!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:35.85,0:40:37.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:35.85,0:40:37.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yohei!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:41.23,0:40:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了，与平？
Dialogue: 1,0:40:41.23,0:40:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it, Yohei?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:44.11,0:40:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的米被偷了。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:44.11,0:40:46.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our rice was stolen.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:46.36,0:40:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你……
Dialogue: 1,0:40:46.36,0:40:47.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You...
Dialogue: 2,0:40:58.71,0:41:01.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这蠢货！我警告过你！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:58.71,0:41:01.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You idiot! I warned you!
Dialogue: 2,0:41:01.83,0:41:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直很小心，可是……
Dialogue: 1,0:41:01.83,0:41:04.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I was careful with it, but. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:41:09.26,0:41:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夜里我甚至抱着那坛子睡……
Dialogue: 1,0:41:09.26,0:41:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}At night, I even slept hugging that jar. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:41:18.98,0:41:20.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去村里！
Dialogue: 1,0:41:18.98,0:41:20.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll go to the village!
Dialogue: 2,0:41:21.65,0:41:26.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你回来之前我怎么办？
Dialogue: 1,0:41:21.65,0:41:26.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But what can I do till you come back?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:26.40,0:41:30.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只剩一份米了。
Dialogue: 1,0:41:26.40,0:41:30.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We only have one portion of rice left.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:23.21,0:42:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这群笨蛋！住手。快收起来。老爷回来了。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:23.21,0:42:27.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You fools! Stop that. Put it away. The master returns.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:33.34,0:42:36.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天保佑。感激不尽。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:33.34,0:42:36.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fate smiled on us. I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:38.85,0:42:40.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么说，你活下来了！
Dialogue: 1,0:42:38.85,0:42:40.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you survived!
Dialogue: 2,0:42:40.98,0:42:44.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你早就没命了。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:40.98,0:42:44.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought you were long gone from this world.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:51.74,0:42:54.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们分手之后出了什么事？
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.74,0:42:54.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened after we parted?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:55.07,0:42:58.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我躲在护城河的芦苇丛里，一直躲到天黑。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:55.07,0:42:58.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I hid under reeds in the moat till night.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:00.58,0:43:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外城烧了起来，
Dialogue: 1,0:43:00.58,0:43:02.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The outer castle burned,
Dialogue: 2,0:43:02.75,0:43:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塌下来压在我身上，我以为死定了。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:02.75,0:43:06.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and when it collapsed on me, I thought I'd die.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:07.38,0:43:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当时心里在想什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:07.38,0:43:09.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What ran through your mind?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:10.88,0:43:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……什么也没想。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.88,0:43:13.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well. . . Nothing really.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:16.22,0:43:18.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你厌倦打仗了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:16.22,0:43:18.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sick of battles?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:27.77,0:43:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我知道一桩苦差事，既没财也没名。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:27.77,0:43:34.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I know of a difficult one with no prospects of wealth or status.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:34.28,0:43:36.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-愿意跟我去吗？  -当然。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:34.28,0:43:36.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Will you join me?   -Sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:37.66,0:43:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次可能会送命。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:37.66,0:43:39.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We might die this time.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:00.51,0:44:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要找的人不会自己送上门。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:00.51,0:44:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What we need won't come.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:02.68,0:44:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么人，大人？
Dialogue: 1,0:44:02.68,0:44:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is that, sir?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:05.02,0:44:07.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-武士。  -—武士？
Dialogue: 1,0:44:05.02,0:44:07.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Samurai.   -Samurai?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:09.31,0:44:13.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是不挑好坏，后头我倒有一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:09.31,0:44:13.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If quality is no issue, I have one out back.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:13.53,0:44:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看他根本算不上什么武士。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:13.53,0:44:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He struck me as a poor excuse for a samurai.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:17.32,0:44:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他讨吃的，又没钱，就说要帮着劈柴。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:17.32,0:44:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He demanded food, but has no money, so he said he'd chop firewood.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:29.83,0:44:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我就喜欢他这股爽快劲儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:29.83,0:44:32.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But I like how clear-cut he is.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:12.88,0:45:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没见过人劈柴？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:12.88,0:45:15.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Never seen a man chop wood before?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:16.00,0:45:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是没见过劈得这么痛快的。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:16.00,0:45:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rather, never as enjoyably.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:18.51,0:45:22.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正我就是这副德行。你要是不嫌弃。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:18.51,0:45:22.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Iam what I am. If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:27.22,0:45:28.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你劈得不错。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:27.22,0:45:28.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're good.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:28.52,0:45:31.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。你该看看我砍人。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:28.52,0:45:31.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. You should see how I cut down men.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:32.36,0:45:33.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你砍过很多人？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:32.36,0:45:33.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You've cut down many?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:34.27,0:45:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那当然。一旦砍起来，就停不下来。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:34.27,0:45:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed. Once I start cutting, there's no cutoff.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:42.03,0:45:44.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我更喜欢先脚底抹油。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.03,0:45:44.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But I prefer to cut and run first.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:46.41,0:45:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，这招可真高明。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.41,0:45:49.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, that's a sharp strategy.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:49.29,0:45:51.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？多谢夸奖。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:49.29,0:45:51.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It is? Thank you kindly.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:58.63,0:46:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}话说回来，砍三十个山贼，你觉得如何？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:58.63,0:46:03.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}By the way, what would you say to cutting down bandits?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:22.45,0:46:23.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来比试吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.45,0:46:23.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to duel!
Dialogue: 2,0:47:55.04,0:47:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真可惜。不分胜负。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:55.04,0:47:57.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What a pity. No winner there.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:57.92,0:47:58.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}错了。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:57.92,0:47:58.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wrong.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:59.63,0:48:00.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赢了。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:59.63,0:48:00.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Iwon.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:04.67,0:48:05.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胡说！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:04.67,0:48:05.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like hell!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:07.43,0:48:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是真刀，你早死了。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:07.43,0:48:10.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A sword would have killed you.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:15.39,0:48:16.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就用真刀！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:15.39,0:48:16.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Real swords then!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:16.94,0:48:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-太鲁莽了。  -—什么？！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:16.94,0:48:18.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Imprudent.   -What?!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:18.56,0:48:23.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还不明白？真刀会要你的命。太鲁莽了。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:18.56,0:48:23.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you see? A real sword will kill you. Imprudent.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:23.69,0:48:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}站住！你要逃？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:23.69,0:48:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! You run from me? !
Dialogue: 2,0:48:29.70,0:48:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拔刀啊！光说不练！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:29.70,0:48:32.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Draw! Talk is cheap!
Dialogue: 2,0:49:11.12,0:49:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是白费力气。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.12,0:49:12.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is futile.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:13.99,0:49:15.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果已经很明显了。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:13.99,0:49:15.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The result is clear.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:47.86,0:49:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有收获吗，大人？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:47.86,0:49:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Any luck, sir?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:53.53,0:49:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这条鱼没钓着。他功夫了得。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:53.53,0:49:57.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We failed to land our catch. His skill is advanced.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:58.04,0:50:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跑掉的鱼总是最大的。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:58.04,0:50:00.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All lost fish seem huge.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:00.41,0:50:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:00.41,0:50:01.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:02.62,0:50:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我亲眼看见的。他杀了个人。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:02.62,0:50:06.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw it with my own eyes. He killed a man.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:13.30,0:50:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}惊人。一个一心只求磨炼自己的人。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:13.30,0:50:19.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stunning. A man rigidly dedicated only to refining himself.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:19.89,0:50:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不肯答应。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:19.89,0:50:21.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He would not accept.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:22.02,0:50:23.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真可惜。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:22.02,0:50:23.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What a shame.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:25.90,0:50:28.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把我们落脚的地方告诉他了。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.90,0:50:28.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I told him where we're staying.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:28.90,0:50:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:28.90,0:50:30.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How about you?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:30.40,0:50:32.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我嘛，钓到一条。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:30.40,0:50:32.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I caught one.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:33.40,0:50:35.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的功夫……不算好。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:33.40,0:50:35.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}His skill is. . . below average.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:36.03,0:50:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不算好？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:36.03,0:50:37.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Below average?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:38.41,0:50:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可人老实，又有趣。跟他说说话，心情都好。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:38.41,0:50:43.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But honest and amusing. Talking to him cheers you up.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:44.42,0:50:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艰难时候，这样的人最难得。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:44.42,0:50:46.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Invaluable in tough times.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:47.59,0:50:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.59,0:50:48.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Much obliged.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:49.92,0:50:53.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，其实我也找到一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:49.92,0:50:53.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, actually, I found one as well.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:53.59,0:50:55.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，那个穿行商衣服的？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:53.59,0:50:55.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, the one in peddler's garb?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:56.10,0:51:00.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正是。那人是我的老同伴。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:56.10,0:51:00.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed. That man is an old companion of mine.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:05.98,0:51:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去打水。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:05.98,0:51:07.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll bring water.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:11.61,0:51:17.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}林田平八。勉强算个劈柴流的传人。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:11.61,0:51:17.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hayashida Heihachi. A humble exponent of the wood chop-style.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:22.58,0:51:25.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，我们还需要三个人。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:22.58,0:51:25.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now then, we need three more.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:25.71,0:51:27.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三个？不是两个？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:25.71,0:51:27.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Three? Not two?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:27.75,0:51:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我们不能带个孩子上路。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:27.75,0:51:30.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we cannot take a child with us.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:32.26,0:51:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}师父！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:32.26,0:51:33.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Master!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:33.72,0:51:38.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，我知道。我知道你想说什么。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:33.72,0:51:38.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, I know. I know what you want to say.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:38.47,0:51:42.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也曾有过你这样的年纪。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:38.47,0:51:42.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Even I was your age once.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:43.77,0:51:49.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}磨炼本领，在战场上扬名，
Dialogue: 1,0:51:43.77,0:51:49.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Honing one's skills, distinguishing oneself in battle,
Dialogue: 2,0:51:49.61,0:51:53.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后成为一城一国之主……
Dialogue: 1,0:51:49.61,0:51:53.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}then becoming lord of a domain and castle. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:51:54.40,0:51:58.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会做这样的梦，可与此同时，
Dialogue: 1,0:51:54.40,0:51:58.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll be dreaming of that, but meanwhile,
Dialogue: 2,0:51:58.24,0:52:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一天你会发现头发已经白了。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:58.24,0:52:02.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}one day, you'll discover your hair's turned gray.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:03.79,0:52:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你会明白，
Dialogue: 1,0:52:03.79,0:52:07.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's more, you'll realize,
Dialogue: 2,0:52:08.00,0:52:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}父母已经不在了，只剩你孤身一人。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:08.00,0:52:11.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}your parents are gone, and you're alone.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:59.59,0:53:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天就回家去吧。你在这儿几天学了不少。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:59.59,0:53:04.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Return home tomorrow. You learned much in a few days here.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:05.22,0:53:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用再学了。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:05.22,0:53:06.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You need no more.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:22.57,0:53:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求您了，大人。把他也带上吧，我求您。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:22.57,0:53:25.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please sir. Bring him too. I beg you.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:25.74,0:53:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—可是……  -—为什么不行？你说他是孩子……
Dialogue: 1,0:53:25.74,0:53:29.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-But. . .   -Why not? You call him a child. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:53:29.75,0:53:33.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子干起活来比大人还卖力。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:29.75,0:53:33.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, kids work harder than grownups.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:34.50,0:53:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前提是拿大人那样使唤。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:34.50,0:53:38.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Only if you work them like grownups though.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:38.88,0:53:41.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我们就拿大人使唤他。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:38.88,0:53:41.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Alright, we'll work him like a grownup.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:47.85,0:53:50.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在还要两个。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:47.85,0:53:50.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now we need two more.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:50.48,0:53:53.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，看来只要一个了。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:50.48,0:53:53.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Only one, it seems.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:00.15,0:54:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大人，您愿意加入我们吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:00.15,0:54:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, you will join us?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:03.49,0:54:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感激不尽。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:03.49,0:54:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My sincere gratitude.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:05.62,0:54:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—出发？  -—明天。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:05.62,0:54:07.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Departure?   -Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:11.29,0:54:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:11.29,0:54:12.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:14.29,0:54:18.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第七个就不要了。没时间耽搁。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:14.29,0:54:18.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll do without a seventh. No time to waste.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:20.80,0:54:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就这么定了！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:20.80,0:54:22.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Alright then!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:25.68,0:54:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}师父！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:25.68,0:54:26.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Master!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:28.43,0:54:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—师父！  -—知道了知道了。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:28.43,0:54:30.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Master!   -Yes yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:31.14,0:54:32.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}师父！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:31.14,0:54:32.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Master!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:32.31,0:54:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道了，知道了。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:32.31,0:54:34.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, we know, we know.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:39.19,0:54:42.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听好了！我找到一个厉害的武士！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:39.19,0:54:42.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen up! I found a mighty samurai!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:42.28,0:54:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们打了一架！他太厉害了！了不起！像条野狗！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:42.28,0:54:47.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We got into a fight! He was too much! Amazing! He's a wild dog!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:47.70,0:54:50.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}架被劝停了，我们就喝酒。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:47.70,0:54:50.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The fight got stopped. We drank.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:50.83,0:54:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们就跟他说了！他答应来了！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:50.83,0:54:53.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then we told him! He's coming!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:56.79,0:54:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老办法，埋伏他？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:56.79,0:54:58.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The usual ambush?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:12.56,0:55:14.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们要干什么？！
Dialogue: 1,0:55:12.56,0:55:14.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What you gonna do? !
Dialogue: 2,0:55:14.85,0:55:15.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}试试他。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:14.85,0:55:15.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Test him.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:18.36,0:55:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不公平！
Dialogue: 1,0:55:18.36,0:55:19.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That ain't fair!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:19.82,0:55:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—喂！武士！  -—看着就行。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:19.82,0:55:22.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey! Samurai!   -Just watch.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:22.36,0:55:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看他挨不挨打。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:22.36,0:55:23.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}See if he gets hit.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:24.11,0:55:26.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可、可他喝醉了！
Dialogue: 1,0:55:24.11,0:55:26.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}B-But, he's drunk!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:26.36,0:55:28.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}武士随时都保持清醒。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:26.36,0:55:28.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A samurai retains his senses.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:29.12,0:55:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，就是这儿！
Dialogue: 1,0:55:29.12,0:55:31.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, this is it!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:31.50,0:55:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没哪个武士比你更强！
Dialogue: 1,0:55:31.50,0:55:34.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No samurai's stronger than you!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:43.26,0:55:44.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好疼！
Dialogue: 1,0:55:43.26,0:55:44.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That hurt!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:44.47,0:55:46.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧？！这不公平！
Dialogue: 1,0:55:44.47,0:55:46.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}See? ! That wasn't fair!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:47.97,0:55:49.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是谁？！
Dialogue: 1,0:55:47.97,0:55:49.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who was it? !
Dialogue: 2,0:55:53.52,0:55:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是哪个混蛋打我？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:53.52,0:55:56.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's the bastard who hit me?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:12.16,0:56:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你？！
Dialogue: 1,0:56:12.16,0:56:13.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You?!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:20.63,0:56:22.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这臭老鼠！
Dialogue: 1,0:56:20.63,0:56:22.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You dirty rat!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:23.17,0:56:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这蠢货！
Dialogue: 1,0:56:23.17,0:56:24.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You jackass!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:27.93,0:56:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这……
Dialogue: 1,0:56:27.93,0:56:29.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You...
Dialogue: 2,0:56:31.93,0:56:35.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看我不揍你！你这蠢货……
Dialogue: 1,0:56:31.93,0:56:35.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll give you a beating! You jackass. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:56:37.81,0:56:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯疯癫癫的蠢货。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.81,0:56:39.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy dumbass.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:49.53,0:56:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你……
Dialogue: 1,0:56:49.53,0:56:51.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It'syou...
Dialogue: 2,0:57:02.79,0:57:04.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}错不了！
Dialogue: 1,0:57:02.79,0:57:04.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ain't no doubt!
Dialogue: 2,0:57:07.09,0:57:10.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做梦我都记得你这颗脑袋。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:07.09,0:57:10.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd remember your head even in a dream.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:13.30,0:57:14.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，你。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:13.30,0:57:14.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. You.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:16.06,0:57:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还有胆子问“你是武士吗”，真是大胆！
Dialogue: 1,0:57:16.06,0:57:21.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You had some nerve to ask, "Are you a samurai? " How dare you!
Dialogue: 2,0:57:23.36,0:57:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好笑。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:23.36,0:57:24.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Real funny.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:29.57,0:57:35.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……看着不像，可我是正儿八经的武士！
Dialogue: 1,0:57:29.57,0:57:35.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I. . . may not look it, but I'm a straight-up samurai!
Dialogue: 2,0:57:39.21,0:57:43.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道吗，我一直在找你。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:39.21,0:57:43.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I've been looking for you ever since.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:44.75,0:57:48.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就为了给你看这个……咦？
Dialogue: 1,0:57:44.75,0:57:48.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}To show you this. . . Huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:57:55.26,0:57:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瞧瞧这个！我的家谱。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:55.26,0:57:58.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get a load of this! My family tree.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:59.14,0:58:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祖上代代相传的谱系。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:59.14,0:58:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A list of my ancestors going way back.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:04.02,0:58:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我什么都不是。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:04.02,0:58:06.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You thought I was nothing.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:09.90,0:58:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}睁大眼睛看好了！
Dialogue: 1,0:58:09.90,0:58:11.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Feast your eyes!
Dialogue: 2,0:58:13.16,0:58:14.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不是闹着玩的！
Dialogue: 1,0:58:13.16,0:58:14.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I ain't no joke!
Dialogue: 2,0:58:21.42,0:58:23.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是我！
Dialogue: 1,0:58:21.42,0:58:23.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is who I am!
Dialogue: 2,0:58:24.79,0:58:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“菊千代”，是你的名字？
Dialogue: 1,0:58:24.79,0:58:27.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"Kikuchiyo, " that's your name?
Dialogue: 2,0:58:27.42,0:58:29.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正是。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:27.42,0:58:29.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Most certainly.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:29.67,0:58:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}生于一五七四年，戌年，二月十七日。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:29.67,0:58:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Born in 1574, 11th sign, February 17th.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:35.89,0:58:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么好笑的？！
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.89,0:58:37.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's so funny? !
Dialogue: 2,0:58:39.56,0:58:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可看不出你才十三岁。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:39.56,0:58:42.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't look to me.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:43.27,0:58:47.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，如果你真像你说的叫菊千代，
Dialogue: 1,0:58:43.27,0:58:47.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, if you are indeed Kikuchiyo as you claim,
Dialogue: 2,0:58:47.40,0:58:50.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今年才满十三岁。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:47.40,0:58:50.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}you turned this year.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:54.66,0:58:57.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是从哪儿偷来的？
Dialogue: 1,0:58:54.66,0:58:57.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you steal this?
Dialogue: 2,0:58:58.04,0:59:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“偷”？混账！
Dialogue: 1,0:58:58.04,0:59:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"Steal"?Dammit!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:04.17,0:59:05.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的武士。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:04.17,0:59:05.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn samurai.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:07.67,0:59:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的武士！你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,0:59:07.67,0:59:10.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn samurai! You jackass!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:12.67,0:59:15.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！臭老鼠！回来！
Dialogue: 1,0:59:12.67,0:59:15.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Dirty rat! Come back!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:16.47,0:59:17.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我回来！
Dialogue: 1,0:59:16.47,0:59:17.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back here!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:18.10,0:59:22.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这混蛋！小兔崽子！去死吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:59:18.10,0:59:22.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You jackass! You little chicken! Go to hell!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:22.48,0:59:24.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来！你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,0:59:22.48,0:59:24.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here! You jackass!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:32.86,0:59:35.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事吧，十三岁？给。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:32.86,0:59:35.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You alright, 13-year-old? Here.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:35.61,0:59:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？！
Dialogue: 1,0:59:35.61,0:59:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Say what? !
Dialogue: 2,0:59:38.37,0:59:39.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这臭老鼠！
Dialogue: 1,0:59:38.37,0:59:39.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You dirty rat!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:45.83,0:59:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚你的！
Dialogue: 1,0:59:45.83,0:59:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw you!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:16.53,1:00:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:00:16.53,1:00:17.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You alright?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:18.99,1:00:20.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代大人。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:18.99,1:00:20.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir Kikuchiyo.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:26.04,1:00:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事吧，十三岁？
Dialogue: 1,1:00:26.04,1:00:28.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You alright, 13-year-old?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:37.42,1:00:40.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿回去塞你武士的屁股吧！
Dialogue: 1,1:00:37.42,1:00:40.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stick it up your samurai ass!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:56.82,1:01:00.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—这也算武士？  -—他自己说是。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:56.82,1:01:00.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is a samurai?   -According to him.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:10.29,1:01:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，带上我吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:10.29,1:01:13.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, take me with you.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:14.09,1:01:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干嘛，为什么不行？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:14.09,1:01:15.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, why not?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:18.22,1:01:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，菊千代。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:18.22,1:01:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Kikuchiyo.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:23.43,1:01:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个交给你了。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:23.43,1:01:25.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take care of this.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:27.22,1:01:30.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，带上我啊！喂！
Dialogue: 1,1:01:27.22,1:01:30.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, take me with you!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:10.89,1:02:12.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么事，爹？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:10.89,1:02:12.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it, Father?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:29.54,1:02:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？这什么表情……
Dialogue: 1,1:02:29.54,1:02:33.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong? Why that look. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:02:42.55,1:02:45.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃，把头发剪了！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:42.55,1:02:45.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino, cut your hair!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:46.30,1:02:48.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剪了！剪了扮成男娃！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:46.30,1:02:48.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut it! Cut it and become a man!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:50.93,1:02:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么呢？！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:50.93,1:02:52.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why say that? !
Dialogue: 2,1:02:52.44,1:02:53.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫你剪就剪！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:52.44,1:02:53.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just cut it!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:54.44,1:02:58.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你长得俊！武士要来了！扮成男的才安全！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:54.44,1:02:58.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're pretty! Samurai are coming! Being a man's safer!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:58.69,1:03:01.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不剪！不！不！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:58.69,1:03:01.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't! No! No!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:04.95,1:03:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！不！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.95,1:03:07.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:14.92,1:03:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:14.92,1:03:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:16.84,1:03:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你这混蛋！  -不！不！不！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:16.84,1:03:20.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Damn you!   -No! No! No!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:33.06,1:03:34.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真蠢。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:33.06,1:03:34.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That'sstupid.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:34.35,1:03:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可万造很了解武士，所以他才把女儿的头发剪了！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:34.35,1:03:39.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But Manzo knows the samurai well. So he cut his daughter's hair!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:40.07,1:03:43.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你家儿子是安全了，可我们的女儿……
Dialogue: 1,1:03:40.07,1:03:43.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Your sons will be safe, but our girls. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:03:43.32,1:03:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！我现在明白了。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:43.32,1:03:46.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damnation! I see now.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:46.36,1:03:50.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就让我女儿去你家！你住得更远。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:46.36,1:03:50.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then take my daughter in! You live further away.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:50.62,1:03:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}白痴！我说的是万造！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:50.62,1:03:53.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Idiot! I was talking about Manzo!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:54.08,1:03:57.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个小矮子根本不管村子，
Dialogue: 1,1:03:54.08,1:03:57.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That runt doesn't care about the village,
Dialogue: 2,1:03:57.58,1:03:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只在乎他女儿！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:57.58,1:03:59.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}only his daughter!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:00.25,1:04:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,1:04:00.25,1:04:01.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That bastard!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:20.77,1:04:22.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只会把事情弄得更糟！
Dialogue: 1,1:04:20.77,1:04:22.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You only made it worse!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:23.40,1:04:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你惹出大乱子了！有女儿的人家都慌了。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:23.40,1:04:27.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You caused an uproar! Parents of daughters are panicking.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:29.66,1:04:34.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底打算怎么办？！武士今天可能就到。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:29.66,1:04:34.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell will you do? ! The samurai might come today.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:35.54,1:04:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！我们去见长老！
Dialogue: 1,1:04:35.54,1:04:38.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, move! Let's go see the elder!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:40.63,1:04:43.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么好看的！回家去！
Dialogue: 1,1:04:40.63,1:04:43.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing to see here! Go home!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:45.05,1:04:46.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家去！
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.05,1:04:46.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go home!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:48.18,1:04:51.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能让武士看到我们这副样子！
Dialogue: 1,1:04:48.18,1:04:51.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't let the samurai see us like this!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:58.56,1:05:00.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还在跟着。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:58.56,1:05:00.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He's still following.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:45.92,1:06:47.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看不见菊千代了。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:45.92,1:06:47.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't see Kikuchiyo.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:48.92,1:06:50.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他放弃了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:48.92,1:06:50.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Did he give up?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:50.92,1:06:55.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说来也怪，没了他，我们还真……
Dialogue: 1,1:06:50.92,1:06:55.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}As strange as it sounds, without him, we'll. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:06:55.51,1:06:56.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-会想他？  -想他？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:55.51,1:06:56.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- Miss him?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:03.19,1:07:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边走。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.19,1:07:04.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thisaway.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:07.15,1:07:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真见鬼。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:07.15,1:07:08.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:21.96,1:07:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么说，那就是我们的城堡？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:21.96,1:07:24.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, that's our castle?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:25.67,1:07:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不会为个粪堆送命。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:25.67,1:07:28.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I ain't dying for a dung pile.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:28.46,1:07:30.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人求你。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:28.46,1:07:30.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody asked you to.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:48.06,1:07:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！我们回来了！武士来了！
Dialogue: 1,1:07:48.06,1:07:53.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! We're back! The samurai are here!
Dialogue: 2,1:07:58.37,1:08:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}武士来了！
Dialogue: 1,1:07:58.37,1:08:00.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the samurai!
Dialogue: 2,1:08:05.12,1:08:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没听见吗？！武士来了！
Dialogue: 1,1:08:05.12,1:08:08.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you hear me? ! The samurai are here!
Dialogue: 2,1:08:14.88,1:08:16.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！怎么回事？！
Dialogue: 1,1:08:14.88,1:08:16.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! What's going on? !
Dialogue: 2,1:08:20.93,1:08:22.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？！
Dialogue: 1,1:08:20.93,1:08:22.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on? !
Dialogue: 2,1:08:36.74,1:08:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是热情的欢迎啊。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:36.74,1:08:39.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What a gracious welcome.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:42.74,1:08:44.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}情况如何？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:42.74,1:08:44.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is the situation?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:47.75,1:08:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！怎么回事？！武士来了！
Dialogue: 1,1:08:47.75,1:08:51.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! What's going on? ! The samurai are here!
Dialogue: 2,1:09:07.77,1:09:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去见长老吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:07.77,1:09:09.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come see the elder.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:09.52,1:09:10.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长老？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:09.52,1:09:10.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The elder?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:10.90,1:09:13.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长老说什么就是什么……
Dialogue: 1,1:09:10.90,1:09:13.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What the elder says, goes. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:09:13.40,1:09:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是你们的村长？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:13.40,1:09:15.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He's your headman?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:17.03,1:09:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜见村长……真是受宠若惊啊。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:17.03,1:09:21.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}An audience with a headman. . . What a humbling honor.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:25.41,1:09:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:25.41,1:09:26.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We shall go.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:39.11,1:10:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这处境真是荒唐。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:39.11,1:10:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is indeed an absurd predicament.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:45.24,1:10:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管下雨、出太阳，还是刮风，
Dialogue: 1,1:10:45.24,1:10:51.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No matter whether the rain falls, the sun shines, or the wind blows,
Dialogue: 2,1:10:51.75,1:10:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}农民总是忧心忡忡。也就是说，
Dialogue: 1,1:10:51.75,1:10:55.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}peasants always worry. That is to say,
Dialogue: 2,1:10:56.75,1:11:02.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}畏畏缩缩就是他们的天性。就像你们今天看到的。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:56.75,1:11:02.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}cowering in fear is their nature. As you witnessed today.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:03.51,1:11:08.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们只是……一如既往罢了。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:03.51,1:11:08.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They were merely. . . acting as they always do.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:12.10,1:11:17.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是长老，村民们到底怕我们什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:12.10,1:11:17.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But Elder. What is it that the villagers fear about us?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:18.23,1:11:22.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}照这样下去，我们怎么能帮上你们？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:18.23,1:11:22.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}As things stand, how can we be of use to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:31.66,1:11:32.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山贼！
Dialogue: 1,1:11:31.66,1:11:32.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bandits!
Dialogue: 2,1:11:52.68,1:11:54.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好武士！
Dialogue: 1,1:11:52.68,1:11:54.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good samurai!
Dialogue: 2,1:11:55.06,1:11:57.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好武士！好武士！
Dialogue: 1,1:11:55.06,1:11:57.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good samurai!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:00.94,1:12:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好武士！好武士！
Dialogue: 1,1:12:00.94,1:12:03.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good samurai!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:15.46,1:12:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安静！冷静！安静！
Dialogue: 1,1:12:15.46,1:12:17.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Quiet! Calm down!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:18.54,1:12:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家冷静！安静！
Dialogue: 1,1:12:18.54,1:12:20.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Calm yourselves! Quiet!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:21.80,1:12:24.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着！冷静点告诉我们。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:21.80,1:12:24.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen! Tell us calmly.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:24.72,1:12:27.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在哪儿看见山贼的？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.72,1:12:27.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where were the bandits seen?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:33.72,1:12:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见的人站出来！
Dialogue: 1,1:12:33.72,1:12:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoever saw them, step forward!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:37.19,1:12:39.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人看见他们吗？！
Dialogue: 1,1:12:37.19,1:12:39.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Did no one see them? !
Dialogue: 2,1:12:39.86,1:12:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谁敲的警钟？！
Dialogue: 1,1:12:39.86,1:12:42.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then who banged the alarm? !
Dialogue: 2,1:12:42.19,1:12:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我！
Dialogue: 1,1:12:42.19,1:12:43.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Idid!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:50.07,1:12:52.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开，你们这些乡巴佬！
Dialogue: 1,1:12:50.07,1:12:52.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Outta my way, you yokels!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:56.87,1:12:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你们那副德性。嗯？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:56.87,1:12:59.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at your faces. Huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:00.88,1:13:03.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放心吧！这儿根本没有山贼！
Dialogue: 1,1:13:00.88,1:13:03.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Relax! Ain't no bandits here!
Dialogue: 2,1:13:09.14,1:13:14.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！乡巴佬！我们来的时候你们是怎么迎接的？嗯？
Dialogue: 1,1:13:09.14,1:13:14.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Yokels! How did you greet us when we came? Huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:15.10,1:13:21.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我敲这杵时，你们却喊‘好武士！好武士！’
Dialogue: 1,1:13:15.10,1:13:21.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But when I hit this pestle, you yelled, "Good samurai! Good samurai! "
Dialogue: 2,1:13:21.86,1:13:23.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜得像我们是神明一样！
Dialogue: 1,1:13:21.86,1:13:23.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Praying as if we're gods!
Dialogue: 2,1:13:28.99,1:13:31.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这些哭哭啼啼的泥腿子。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:28.99,1:13:31.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You sniveling mud snails.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:49.42,1:13:51.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老头儿，有意见吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:13:49.42,1:13:51.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Pops, got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:52.05,1:13:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。这招还真管用。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:52.05,1:13:55.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nope. It did the trick.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:01.56,1:14:06.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}钝剪刀也有用武之地。现在我们凑够七个人了。
Dialogue: 1,1:14:01.56,1:14:06.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Even blunt scissors come in handy. That makes seven of us.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:14.41,1:14:15.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，这儿太脏了。
Dialogue: 1,1:14:14.41,1:14:15.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry it's filthy.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:16.08,1:14:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可这是你的房子。你怎么办？
Dialogue: 1,1:14:16.08,1:14:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But this is your house. What will you do?
Dialogue: 2,1:14:20.58,1:14:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我睡马厩。  -跟马睡？
Dialogue: 1,1:14:20.58,1:14:23.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll sleep in the stable.   -With horses?
Dialogue: 2,1:14:25.34,1:14:28.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。去年，山贼……
Dialogue: 1,1:14:25.34,1:14:28.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Last year, the bandits. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:14:45.86,1:14:49.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是有老婆陪着，马厩也不赖。
Dialogue: 1,1:14:45.86,1:14:49.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A stable ain't so bad, if wifey's with ya.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:53.49,1:14:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有老婆！
Dialogue: 1,1:14:53.49,1:14:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have a wife!
Dialogue: 2,1:14:55.32,1:14:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,1:14:55.32,1:14:57.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy bastard!
Dialogue: 2,1:15:09.38,1:15:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯混蛋。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:09.38,1:15:10.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy bastard.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:18.51,1:15:20.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,1:15:18.51,1:15:20.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's his problem?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:24.40,1:15:26.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你真名叫什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:15:24.40,1:15:26.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So what's your real name?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:29.02,1:15:33.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我忘了。要名字的话，就给我起个合适的。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:29.02,1:15:33.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I forgot. If I need a name, gimme one that suits me.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:34.11,1:15:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就叫菊千代。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:34.11,1:15:35.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo it is.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:35.86,1:15:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-菊千代？  -对，挺适合你。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:35.86,1:15:38.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Kikuchiyo?   -Yeah. It suits you.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:00.68,1:16:03.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会怎么计划进攻？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:00.68,1:16:03.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How would you plan an attack?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:03.64,1:16:06.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先冲下这座山。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:03.64,1:16:06.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}First, rush down this mountain.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:06.52,1:16:09.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。多半走这条路。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:06.52,1:16:09.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Most likely this road.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:10.40,1:16:14.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“西”
Dialogue: 1,1:16:10.40,1:16:14.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"West"
Dialogue: 2,1:16:27.71,1:16:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你会怎么防守？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:27.71,1:16:30.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, how would you defend?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:30.71,1:16:32.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}七郎次知道怎么防。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:30.71,1:16:32.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shichiroji knows how.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:33.59,1:16:37.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见那些圆木了吗？用来做防骑兵的路障。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:33.59,1:16:37.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}See those logs? For anti-cavalry barricades.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:37.22,1:16:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊哈。你的老搭档。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:37.22,1:16:39.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Aha. Your old companion.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:58.86,1:17:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！
Dialogue: 1,1:16:58.86,1:17:00.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Alright!
Dialogue: 2,1:17:08.71,1:17:11.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！都听好了。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:08.71,1:17:11.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Alright! Listen up.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:13.21,1:17:18.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打仗就是靠跑。进攻、防守，都得跑。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:13.21,1:17:18.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}War is all about running. Offense, defense, it's all running.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:18.76,1:17:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}战场上，要么跑，要么死。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:18.76,1:17:21.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}In war, you either run or die.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:39.40,1:17:43.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“南”
Dialogue: 1,1:17:39.40,1:17:43.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"South"
Dialogue: 2,1:17:55.55,1:17:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等大麦一收割完，我们就放水淹这里。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:55.55,1:17:59.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Once the barley's cut, we'll flood this.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:59.51,1:18:04.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}灌溉能帮我们防守。但来得及吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:17:59.51,1:18:04.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Irrigation would help us defend. But do we have time?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:13.19,1:18:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刺！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:13.19,1:18:14.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thrust!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:15.65,1:18:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:15.65,1:18:17.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do it!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:17.69,1:18:20.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我当山贼！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:17.69,1:18:20.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Imagine I am a bandit!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:22.78,1:18:24.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刺！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:22.78,1:18:24.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thrust!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:27.70,1:18:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}照我说的做！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:27.70,1:18:29.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do as I say!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:38.34,1:18:39.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一个！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:38.34,1:18:39.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Next!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:41.55,1:18:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一个！下一个在哪儿？！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:41.55,1:18:44.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Next! Where is the next man? !
Dialogue: 2,1:19:09.45,1:19:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“东”
Dialogue: 1,1:19:09.45,1:19:12.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"East"
Dialogue: 2,1:19:16.21,1:19:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拆掉这座桥，就能挡住东边的进攻。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:16.21,1:19:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Taking down this bridge would thwart eastern attacks.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:27.76,1:19:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可那边的房子怎么办？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:27.76,1:19:30.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But what about the houses there?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:38.27,1:19:40.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最远的先撤。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:38.27,1:19:40.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Evacuate the furthest.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:45.28,1:19:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水磨坊也撤？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:45.28,1:19:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The water mill hut too?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:49.24,1:19:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那老头太倔了。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:49.24,1:19:52.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That old man's too headstrong.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:58.67,1:20:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说。你们怕敌人，谁都会怕。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:58.67,1:20:03.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hear me out. You fear your enemy. Anybody would fear them.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:03.80,1:20:07.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你们看，他们也怕我们。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:03.80,1:20:07.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But you see, they're afraid of us too.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:36.58,1:20:38.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真是服了你。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:36.58,1:20:38.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in awe of ya.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:39.34,1:20:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都能去当稻草人。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:39.34,1:20:41.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd all make great scarecrows.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:44.42,1:20:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可咱们的对手不是麻雀乌鸦！
Dialogue: 1,1:20:44.42,1:20:48.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But we ain't up against Sparrows or crows!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:56.60,1:21:00.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，你这反刍的畜生，快住手。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:56.60,1:21:00.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey you, cud-chewer. Give it up now.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:04.48,1:21:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿不是牲口棚！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:04.48,1:21:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This ain't a barn!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:09.45,1:21:11.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我身边全是废物。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:09.45,1:21:11.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm surrounded by losers.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:14.83,1:21:19.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一群蠢货！喂！前排的，出列！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:14.83,1:21:19.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn fools! Hey! You at the front, step forward!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:22.25,1:21:23.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:22.25,1:21:23.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You, dammit!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:24.76,1:21:26.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说了就是你！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:24.76,1:21:26.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You, I said!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:46.28,1:21:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！这表演可不是白看的！掏钱！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:46.28,1:21:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! This show ain't free! Pay up!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:08.42,1:22:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:08.42,1:22:09.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What'sthis?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:11.14,1:22:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是长枪，先生。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:11.14,1:22:12.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A spear, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:13.01,1:22:16.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蠢货。说，哪儿来的？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:13.01,1:22:16.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dummy. Tell me where you got it.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:17.89,1:22:20.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山上长出来的吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:17.89,1:22:20.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Did it grow on the mountain?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:22.81,1:22:26.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道了。你杀了落难武士抢来的。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:22.81,1:22:26.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. You got that by killing a fallen samurai.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:27.19,1:22:31.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一支就有更多。说啊？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:27.19,1:22:31.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If you've got one, there've gotta be more. Well?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:31.95,1:22:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说！快他妈说！
Dialogue: 1,1:22:31.95,1:22:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Speak up! Speak the hell up!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:44.21,1:22:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“北”
Dialogue: 1,1:22:44.21,1:22:46.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"North"
Dialogue: 2,1:22:47.59,1:22:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“神水”
Dialogue: 1,1:22:47.59,1:22:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"Divine water"
Dialogue: 2,1:22:55.22,1:23:00.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，多安静的林子。可这里最危险。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:55.22,1:23:00.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, such a serene forest. But it's most dangerous here.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:36.22,1:23:37.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:36.22,1:23:37.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:38.10,1:23:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们走。  -是，师父。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:38.10,1:23:40.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-We're going.   -Yes Master.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:48.27,1:23:50.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}果然还是个孩子。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:48.27,1:23:50.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a child alright.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:51.84,1:24:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，是村民吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:24:51.84,1:24:54.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You there. Are you a villager?
Dialogue: 2,1:24:59.47,1:25:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是女人？
Dialogue: 1,1:24:59.47,1:25:00.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Awoman?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:04.47,1:25:05.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是男人？
Dialogue: 1,1:25:04.47,1:25:05.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Aman?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:07.35,1:25:09.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那怎么不拿长枪？！
Dialogue: 1,1:25:07.35,1:25:09.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then why no spear? !
Dialogue: 2,1:25:09.98,1:25:13.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}年轻人现在可不是摘花的时候！
Dialogue: 1,1:25:09.98,1:25:13.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is no time for a young man to pick flowers!
Dialogue: 2,1:25:14.94,1:25:17.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来！我教你！
Dialogue: 1,1:25:14.94,1:25:17.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come! I'll train you!
Dialogue: 2,1:25:17.70,1:25:19.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快来！
Dialogue: 1,1:25:17.70,1:25:19.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come now!
Dialogue: 2,1:25:23.87,1:25:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,1:25:23.87,1:25:25.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn you!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:29.81,1:26:34.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿、这儿都没问题。问题在这儿。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:29.81,1:26:34.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All good here, and here. Here's the problem.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:40.95,1:26:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都给我滚！
Dialogue: 1,1:26:40.95,1:26:43.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You can all piss off!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:44.07,1:26:46.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都给我动起来！
Dialogue: 1,1:26:44.07,1:26:46.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Move your raggedy asses!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:51.83,1:26:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大丰收！
Dialogue: 1,1:26:51.83,1:26:53.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A huge haul!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:00.17,1:27:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:00.17,1:27:01.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What'sthis?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:01.59,1:27:03.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从落难武士身上弄来的。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:01.59,1:27:03.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Taken from a fallen samurai.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:05.68,1:27:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪儿来的？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:05.68,1:27:07.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:07.68,1:27:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这村子里的？！
Dialogue: 1,1:27:07.68,1:27:08.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This village? !
Dialogue: 2,1:27:08.81,1:27:10.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，万造家。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:08.81,1:27:10.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, at Manzo's.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:20.36,1:27:21.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:20.36,1:27:21.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:24.24,1:27:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不喜欢？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:24.24,1:27:25.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't like it?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:28.20,1:27:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可是上等货。看？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:28.20,1:27:30.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's top quality. See?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:32.00,1:27:36.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？你们说要盔甲、长枪、弓箭。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:32.00,1:27:36.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong? You said you want armor, spears, and bows.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:36.84,1:27:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-全在这儿。  -你还算武士吗？！
Dialogue: 1,1:27:36.84,1:27:39.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's all here.   -Call yourself a samurai? !
Dialogue: 2,1:27:41.21,1:27:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}农民是杀了武士才弄到这盔甲的！
Dialogue: 1,1:27:41.21,1:27:44.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Peasants got this armor by killing samurai!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:44.51,1:27:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:44.51,1:27:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:45.89,1:27:48.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那你怎么能……  -够了！
Dialogue: 1,1:27:45.89,1:27:48.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Then how could you. . .   -Enough!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:49.76,1:27:53.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有被追杀的武士才懂。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:49.76,1:27:53.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Only samurai who've been hunted can understand.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:01.23,1:28:02.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}王八蛋！
Dialogue: 1,1:28:01.23,1:28:02.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastards!
Dialogue: 2,1:28:06.41,1:28:08.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别理他。快走！
Dialogue: 1,1:28:06.41,1:28:08.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Pay no mind. Get out of here!
Dialogue: 2,1:28:32.26,1:28:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在真想杀了这些村民。
Dialogue: 1,1:28:32.26,1:28:37.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I am of a mind to kill these villagers now.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:51.08,1:28:52.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，有何不可？
Dialogue: 1,1:28:51.08,1:28:52.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:55.46,1:28:59.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，你们。你们以为农民是什么样？
Dialogue: 1,1:28:55.46,1:28:59.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. You lot. What did you think peasants are like?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:00.04,1:29:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以为是圣人？啊？
Dialogue: 1,1:29:00.04,1:29:02.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought they were saints? Huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:03.21,1:29:07.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别逗我笑！没谁比他们更狡猾！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:03.21,1:29:07.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't make me laugh! No creature's more cunning!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:13.31,1:29:17.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没米！没麦！说什么都没有！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:13.31,1:29:17.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No rice! No barley! Nothing to give, they say!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:20.10,1:29:24.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可他们有。他们什么都有。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:20.10,1:29:24.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But they've got it. They've got everything.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:25.32,1:29:29.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挖他们地板底下！查他们仓库！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:25.32,1:29:29.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dig under their floors! Check their storehouses!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:29.61,1:29:34.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们能找出好多！成坛的米！盐！豆子！酒！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:29.61,1:29:34.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll find plenty! Jars of rice! Salt! Beans! Booze!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:40.08,1:29:43.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山里还藏着稻田！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:40.08,1:29:43.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rice fields hidden in the hills!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:43.71,1:29:48.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}装老实，说假话。把真相瞒着！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:43.71,1:29:48.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They act honest and lie. They cover up the truth!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:48.88,1:29:52.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}削竹枪杀落难武士！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:48.88,1:29:52.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Making bamboo spears to kill fallen samurai!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:54.76,1:29:59.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听见没？！农民是吝啬鬼！骗子！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:54.76,1:29:59.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You hear me? ! Peasants are misers! Cheats!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:59.27,1:30:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱哭鬼！两面派！蠢货！
Dialogue: 1,1:29:59.27,1:30:03.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Crybabies! Double-crossers! Halfwits!
Dialogue: 2,1:30:03.65,1:30:05.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是杀人犯！
Dialogue: 1,1:30:03.65,1:30:05.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And killers!
Dialogue: 2,1:30:05.78,1:30:08.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真让人想哭！
Dialogue: 1,1:30:05.78,1:30:08.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's enough to make you cry!
Dialogue: 2,1:30:12.49,1:30:16.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}话说回来，是谁把他们变成这样的畜生？
Dialogue: 1,1:30:12.49,1:30:16.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then again, who turned them into such beasts?
Dialogue: 2,1:30:16.62,1:30:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你们！你们武士！
Dialogue: 1,1:30:16.62,1:30:19.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You did! You samurai!
Dialogue: 2,1:30:20.42,1:30:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蠢货……
Dialogue: 1,1:30:20.42,1:30:21.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn fools. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:30:29.05,1:30:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打仗时你们烧村子！踩庄稼！
Dialogue: 1,1:30:29.05,1:30:32.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}In war, you burn villages! Trample fields!
Dialogue: 2,1:30:32.76,1:30:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抢他们的粮食！把他们当奴隶！
Dialogue: 1,1:30:32.76,1:30:36.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You take their food! You treat them like slaves!
Dialogue: 2,1:30:36.89,1:30:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抢女人！反抗就杀！
Dialogue: 1,1:30:36.89,1:30:39.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You steal women! They resist, you kill!
Dialogue: 2,1:30:40.14,1:30:44.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}农民能怎么办？！他们他妈能怎么办？！
Dialogue: 1,1:30:40.14,1:30:44.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What can peasants do? ! What the hell can they do? !
Dialogue: 2,1:30:44.69,1:30:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋……混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,1:30:44.69,1:30:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dammit...Dammit!
Dialogue: 2,1:31:24.85,1:31:28.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来，你也是农民出身。
Dialogue: 1,1:31:24.85,1:31:28.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you were born a peasant.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:06.02,1:32:09.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又……出什么事了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:32:06.02,1:32:09.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is something. . . wrong again?
Dialogue: 2,1:32:09.61,1:32:13.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，没事。再也不会了。
Dialogue: 1,1:32:09.61,1:32:13.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, nothing. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:19.30,1:33:22.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我。从今晚起，我睡这儿。
Dialogue: 1,1:33:19.30,1:33:22.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's me. From tonight, I'm sleeping here.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:23.81,1:33:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟他们在一起我喘不过气。
Dialogue: 1,1:33:23.81,1:33:26.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't breathe around them.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:27.94,1:33:33.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笨蛋！别这么胆小！这是你的地盘。
Dialogue: 1,1:33:27.94,1:33:33.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbass! Quit being so timid! This is your turf.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:34.11,1:33:36.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把房子让出来了，睡这儿。
Dialogue: 1,1:33:34.11,1:33:36.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You gave up the house, and sleep here.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:37.11,1:33:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个也别让。睡吧！
Dialogue: 1,1:33:37.11,1:33:40.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't give this up too. Go to sleep!
Dialogue: 2,1:33:57.38,1:33:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像从前一样……
Dialogue: 1,1:33:57.38,1:33:59.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like old times. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:34:17.65,1:34:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真安静啊。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:17.65,1:34:19.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It'squiet.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:22.53,1:34:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样的日子，真想不到那座山上有山贼。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:22.53,1:34:27.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}On a day like this, I can't imagine bandits on that mountain.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:28.91,1:34:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉，管他呢！要是有个女人就好了。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:28.91,1:34:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, screw this! If only there were women.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:41.93,1:34:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-去哪儿？  -上山。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:41.93,1:34:43.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where to?   -The mountain.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:43.43,1:34:45.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-上山？！  -活动活动筋骨。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:43.43,1:34:45.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-The mountain? !   -For exercise.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:47.06,1:34:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山上可没有女人。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:47.06,1:34:48.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No women up there.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:50.64,1:34:52.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你偶尔还挺机灵。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:50.64,1:34:52.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now and then, you're sharp.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:54.40,1:34:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在做什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:54.40,1:34:56.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you making?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:56.94,1:34:58.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-旗子。  -旗子？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:56.94,1:34:58.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Abanner.   -Abanner?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:59.32,1:35:05.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打起仗来，上头没个飘扬的东西，心里就发慌。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:59.32,1:35:05.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}In battle, if there's nothing flying high, you feel alone.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:10.04,1:35:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:10.04,1:35:11.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:11.83,1:35:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最底下这个符号是农民。就是这个村子。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:11.83,1:35:16.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The bottom symbol represents the peasants. This village.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:16.54,1:35:18.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。那这些圈呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:16.54,1:35:18.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh. And those circles?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:18.71,1:35:20.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我们。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:18.71,1:35:20.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They're us.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:20.96,1:35:23.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有六个。把我落下了。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:20.96,1:35:23.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There are only six. I'm left out.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:23.72,1:35:26.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，这个三角就是你，菊千代大人。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:23.72,1:35:26.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, this triangle is you, Sir Kikuchiyo.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:27.10,1:35:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这招真妙！
Dialogue: 1,1:35:27.10,1:35:28.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now that's clever!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:50.05,1:36:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是米饭。你就吃吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:50.05,1:36:53.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is rice. Just eat it.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:53.18,1:36:54.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:53.18,1:36:54.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:54.27,1:36:58.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉分了些给我。全是小米。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:54.27,1:36:58.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi gave me some of his. It was all millet.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:59.44,1:37:01.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那哪算饭。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:59.44,1:37:01.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not food.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:02.94,1:37:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃这个。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:02.94,1:37:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Eat this.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:15.96,1:37:19.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快吃。你要是不好意思，我就走。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:15.96,1:37:19.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Eat it quickly. If you're shy, I'll go.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:19.67,1:37:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不吃。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:19.67,1:37:21.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I ain't gonna eat it.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:21.71,1:37:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？弄来可不容易……
Dialogue: 1,1:37:21.71,1:37:23.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why? It wasn't easy. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:37:24.09,1:37:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。这个……太金贵了。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:24.09,1:37:28.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. This is. . . too precious.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:29.22,1:37:32.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拿去给九右卫门家的阿婆。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:29.22,1:37:32.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll take it to Kyuemon's granny.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:32.85,1:37:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}九右卫门家的阿婆？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:32.85,1:37:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kyuemon'sgranny?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:56.12,1:38:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉，我吃饱了。我这份留着以后吃。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:56.12,1:38:00.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi, I'm full. I'll save mine for later.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:01.25,1:38:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，现在就吃。我的那份留着。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:01.25,1:38:05.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, eat now. I'll leave mine.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:06.84,1:38:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是怎么回事？出什么事了。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:06.84,1:38:10.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's all this? Something's going on.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:10.64,1:38:11.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:10.64,1:38:11.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:20.02,1:38:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可怜的女人。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:20.02,1:38:21.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Poor woman.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:23.40,1:38:24.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没有家人吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:23.40,1:38:24.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Has she no family?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:25.02,1:38:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，都被山贼杀了。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:25.02,1:38:27.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, bandits killed them all.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:34.16,1:38:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……真想现在就死了。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:34.16,1:38:41.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I. . . wish I could die right now.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:41.42,1:38:46.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想早点死，好得个解脱，
Dialogue: 1,1:38:41.42,1:38:46.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to die soon, so I can be free
Dialogue: 2,1:38:47.42,1:38:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脱离这苦日子。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:47.42,1:38:50.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}from this suffering.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:51.68,1:38:56.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你知道，到了那个世界，
Dialogue: 1,1:38:51.68,1:38:56.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But you know, in the next world,
Dialogue: 2,1:38:57.26,1:39:03.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是不是还有更多的苦等着我？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:57.26,1:39:03.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}is there more suffering waiting for me?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:05.06,1:39:06.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，没有了。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:05.06,1:39:06.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, there isn't.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:07.07,1:39:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个世界没有战乱，也没有山贼。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:07.07,1:39:11.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}In the next world, there are no wars, or bandits.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:11.78,1:39:13.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点都不苦，阿婆。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:11.78,1:39:13.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No pain at all, Granny.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:14.03,1:39:17.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别骗她！你见过那个世界吗？！
Dialogue: 1,1:39:14.03,1:39:17.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't lie to her! Ever seen the next world? !
Dialogue: 2,1:39:17.83,1:39:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干吗老是大吼大叫？
Dialogue: 1,1:39:17.83,1:39:19.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why yell all the time?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:19.83,1:39:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最见不得人受苦！这些蛆虫让我恶心！
Dialogue: 1,1:39:19.83,1:39:23.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I hate seeing suffering! These maggots sicken me!
Dialogue: 2,1:39:26.84,1:39:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扭来扭去，苦苦挣扎！
Dialogue: 1,1:39:26.84,1:39:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Writhing and squirming!
Dialogue: 2,1:39:30.42,1:39:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混账！我们就不能拼一把吗？！
Dialogue: 1,1:39:30.42,1:39:33.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dammit! Can't we stick our necks out? !
Dialogue: 2,1:39:33.84,1:39:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}留着这股劲，等山贼来了再使。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:33.84,1:39:37.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold that thought, until the bandits come.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:53.49,1:39:54.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说……
Dialogue: 1,1:39:53.49,1:39:54.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:39:57.12,1:40:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说，你为什么没有……
Dialogue: 1,1:39:57.12,1:40:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me, why didn't you. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:40:00.70,1:40:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你看见了吧？我和……
Dialogue: 1,1:40:00.70,1:40:06.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you saw, didn't you? Me. . . and. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:40:06.21,1:40:07.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个女人？
Dialogue: 1,1:40:06.21,1:40:07.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That woman?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:07.50,1:40:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。可你为什么没有……
Dialogue: 1,1:40:07.50,1:40:11.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. And yet, why didn't you. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:40:11.38,1:40:13.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我动手？
Dialogue: 1,1:40:11.38,1:40:13.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me to?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:28.15,1:40:29.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我米饭！
Dialogue: 1,1:40:28.15,1:40:29.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Gimme rice!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:30.52,1:40:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我白米饭！
Dialogue: 1,1:40:30.52,1:40:32.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Gimme white rice!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:37.28,1:40:40.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小兔崽子！这儿没有米饭！
Dialogue: 1,1:40:37.28,1:40:40.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Little punks! Ain't no rice here!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:46.50,1:40:48.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安静，安静！
Dialogue: 1,1:40:46.50,1:40:48.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Settle down, settle down!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:48.79,1:40:55.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有这么大劲，就别再喊“给我米饭”了！
Dialogue: 1,1:40:48.79,1:40:55.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If you've got that much energy, quit yelling "Gimme rice! Gimme rice! "
Dialogue: 2,1:40:56.51,1:40:59.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听好了！你们这些小兔崽子！
Dialogue: 1,1:40:56.51,1:40:59.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get this! Listen, you little pissants!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:01.68,1:41:06.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只能拿出这么多！再多给，我们就……
Dialogue: 1,1:41:01.68,1:41:06.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is all we can spare! If we give you more, we'll be. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:41:11.06,1:41:12.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:11.06,1:41:12.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like that.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:12.78,1:41:16.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，你们谁有个漂亮的姐姐？
Dialogue: 1,1:41:12.78,1:41:16.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, any of you got a pretty big sister?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:18.95,1:41:22.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有姐姐吗？你有姐姐吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:41:18.95,1:41:22.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You got a big sister?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:22.95,1:41:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说老爷子，什么时候收割？
Dialogue: 1,1:41:22.95,1:41:26.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, old man, when will you harvest?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:28.83,1:41:30.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十天以后。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:28.83,1:41:30.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}In days time.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:30.84,1:41:33.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最快能多快收完？
Dialogue: 1,1:41:30.84,1:41:33.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How quickly can you do it?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:35.09,1:41:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看……三天吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:35.09,1:41:37.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd say. . . three days.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:38.84,1:41:41.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来我要灌水。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:38.84,1:41:41.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to irrigate next.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:41.34,1:41:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打算在南边挖条壕沟。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:41.34,1:41:45.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The idea is to build a moat to the south.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:45.35,1:41:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了挡马。不是所有田，隔一块挖一条。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:45.35,1:41:50.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}To stop horses. Not all fields. Every second one.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:51.23,1:41:57.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样的话，挖堤放水淹田，得要一天……
Dialogue: 1,1:41:51.23,1:41:57.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If so, to break levees and flood fields, we'll need a day. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:41:57.82,1:41:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。明白了。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:57.82,1:41:59.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Alright. Understood.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:00.36,1:42:02.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还有件事想求大家。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:00.36,1:42:02.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I have another favor to ask.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:03.08,1:42:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}远处那三户人家，还有这座水磨房。请在收割前搬走。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:03.08,1:42:09.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The three far houses and this mill hut. Please abandon them before the harvest.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:10.62,1:42:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爹！
Dialogue: 1,1:42:10.62,1:42:11.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Father!
Dialogue: 2,1:42:12.50,1:42:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要我们丢下家？！
Dialogue: 1,1:42:12.50,1:42:14.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Abandon our homes? !
Dialogue: 2,1:42:16.00,1:42:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当家的……
Dialogue: 1,1:42:16.00,1:42:17.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Husband...
Dialogue: 2,1:42:17.88,1:42:19.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爹！
Dialogue: 1,1:42:17.88,1:42:19.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Father!
Dialogue: 2,1:42:22.14,1:42:24.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们知道这要求过分……
Dialogue: 1,1:42:22.14,1:42:24.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We are asking a lot. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:42:26.10,1:42:27.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但必须这么做。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:26.10,1:42:27.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}. . . but it must be done.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:29.77,1:42:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那三户在村外，我们守不住。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:29.77,1:42:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't defend the three outlying houses.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:54.92,1:42:58.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着。麦子很快就要收割了，
Dialogue: 1,1:42:54.92,1:42:58.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen. The barley harvest begins soon,
Dialogue: 2,1:42:58.42,1:43:02.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收完山贼就会来。一定会的。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:58.42,1:43:02.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}after which bandits will attack. Count on that.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:02.68,1:43:06.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一开始收割，就要准备打仗。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:02.68,1:43:06.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}When the harvest begins, prepare to fight.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:06.76,1:43:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}按组收割，不要按户。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:06.76,1:43:10.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Harvest in groups, not families.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:10.81,1:43:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，从明天起，按组住在一起。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:10.81,1:43:14.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Also, from tomorrow, live in those groups.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:15.44,1:43:20.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我的话。从明天起，只照我说的做。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:15.44,1:43:20.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Heed my word. From tomorrow, do only as you're told.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:21.53,1:43:23.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，大家。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:21.53,1:43:23.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Everybody.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:23.70,1:43:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚，让你们老婆好好快活一回。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:23.70,1:43:28.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight, give your wife the thrill of her life.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:48.97,1:43:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混账！你就当是开玩笑是吧？！
Dialogue: 1,1:43:48.97,1:43:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dammit! It's just a big joke to you, huh? !
Dialogue: 2,1:43:52.94,1:43:55.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}村外那几户的人，过来！
Dialogue: 1,1:43:52.94,1:43:55.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Far house dwellers, come!
Dialogue: 2,1:43:58.36,1:44:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把那些东西都扔了！
Dialogue: 1,1:43:58.36,1:44:00.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dump those things!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:00.61,1:44:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凭啥要丢下自己的家去守别人的！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:00.61,1:44:04.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No need to abandon our homes to defend others'!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:05.61,1:44:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走！我们守自己的家去！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:05.61,1:44:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! We'll defend our own homes!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:11.24,1:44:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:11.24,1:44:12.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:16.00,1:44:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿起长矛！各归各位！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:16.00,1:44:19.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Pick up your spears! Return to your ranks!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:45.86,1:44:47.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}集合！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:45.86,1:44:47.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fall in!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:52.24,1:44:53.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}集合！集合！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:52.24,1:44:53.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fall in!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:53.91,1:44:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平在哪？！与平！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:53.91,1:44:56.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where'sYohei?!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:56.79,1:44:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在哪？！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:56.79,1:44:58.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is he? !
Dialogue: 2,1:44:58.17,1:44:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平在哪？！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:58.17,1:44:59.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where'sYohei?!
Dialogue: 2,1:45:00.67,1:45:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平！他跑哪去了？！
Dialogue: 1,1:45:00.67,1:45:02.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yohei! Where'd he go? !
Dialogue: 2,1:45:05.26,1:45:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这笨蛋！在这边，混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,1:45:05.26,1:45:08.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You dumbass! Over here, dammit!
Dialogue: 2,1:45:26.07,1:45:30.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外围三户！村里有二十户！
Dialogue: 1,1:45:26.07,1:45:30.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Three outlying houses! houses in the village!
Dialogue: 2,1:45:31.95,1:45:35.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能为了三户冒二十户的险！
Dialogue: 1,1:45:31.95,1:45:35.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't risk houses for the sake of three!
Dialogue: 2,1:45:37.16,1:45:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，如果村子被攻破，
Dialogue: 1,1:45:37.16,1:45:41.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's more, if this village is overrun,
Dialogue: 2,1:45:42.34,1:45:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外围的屋子也一样！
Dialogue: 1,1:45:42.34,1:45:44.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}so the far houses will be!
Dialogue: 2,1:45:48.59,1:45:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听见没？打仗就是这样！
Dialogue: 1,1:45:48.59,1:45:52.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you hear me? Such is war!
Dialogue: 2,1:45:53.60,1:45:56.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保护别人就是保护自己！
Dialogue: 1,1:45:53.60,1:45:56.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Protect others to protect yourself!
Dialogue: 2,1:45:58.44,1:46:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只顾自己的人只会害了自己！
Dialogue: 1,1:45:58.44,1:46:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Those who think only of themselves doom themselves!
Dialogue: 2,1:46:06.61,1:46:10.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果……你们再有人这样……
Dialogue: 1,1:46:06.61,1:46:10.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If. . . any more of you do so. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:46:38.22,1:51:37.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幕间休息
Dialogue: 1,1:46:38.22,1:51:37.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}INTERMISSION
Dialogue: 2,1:52:42.51,1:52:45.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狡猾的家伙！果然藏了姑娘。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:42.51,1:52:45.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sneaky bastards! They had girls after all.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:46.26,1:52:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！与平！
Dialogue: 1,1:52:46.26,1:52:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dammit! Yohei!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:48.39,1:52:49.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平！
Dialogue: 1,1:52:48.39,1:52:49.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yohei!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:52.77,1:52:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把那些姑娘藏哪了？
Dialogue: 1,1:52:52.77,1:52:55.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did ya hide those girls?
Dialogue: 2,1:53:00.40,1:53:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笑吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:53:00.40,1:53:01.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Laugh it up.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:10.04,1:53:12.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，把那镰刀给我。
Dialogue: 1,1:53:10.04,1:53:12.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Gimme that sickle.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:13.42,1:53:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我多割三倍。作为交换，咱们亲近亲近。
Dialogue: 1,1:53:13.42,1:53:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll cut three times more. In exchange, let's get familiar.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:42.78,1:53:44.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉。
Dialogue: 1,1:53:42.78,1:53:44.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:45.41,1:53:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}依我看，成双成对的最有干劲。
Dialogue: 1,1:53:45.41,1:53:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}From what I can see, couples pull in the most.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:49.79,1:53:51.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}趁早娶个媳妇吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:53:49.79,1:53:51.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Better get a wife soon.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:55.33,1:53:59.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，你生什么气？我只说了「娶媳妇」……
Dialogue: 1,1:53:55.33,1:53:59.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Why are you mad? I only said "get a wife". . .
Dialogue: 2,1:54:00.67,1:54:05.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎。去把利吉叫来！这时候跑哪去了……
Dialogue: 1,1:54:00.67,1:54:05.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro. Go get Rikichi! What a time to run Off. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:54:06.43,1:54:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉！
Dialogue: 1,1:54:06.43,1:54:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:08.97,1:54:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉！
Dialogue: 1,1:54:08.97,1:54:10.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:14.35,1:54:16.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃，醒醒。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:14.35,1:54:16.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino, snap out of it.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:33.20,1:54:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞什么？熊睡这儿吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:54:33.20,1:54:36.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell? Do bears sleep here?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:38.63,1:54:40.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被镰刀割的。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:38.63,1:54:40.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut by a sickle.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:43.13,1:54:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉干的？
Dialogue: 1,1:54:43.13,1:54:44.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi did this?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:44.76,1:54:49.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。我没看见，可我跟他走散后来这儿，
Dialogue: 1,1:54:44.76,1:54:49.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. I didn't see it, but when I lost him and came here,
Dialogue: 2,1:54:49.85,1:54:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他从那边出来。瞪着眼，满头大汗。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:49.85,1:54:54.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}he emerged from there. All wide-eyed, and sweaty.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:58.65,1:55:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:54:58.65,1:55:00.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you say?
Dialogue: 2,1:55:00.52,1:55:04.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。我只叫他「娶媳妇」。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:00.52,1:55:04.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing. I only told him to "get a wife. "
Dialogue: 2,1:55:07.28,1:55:11.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那人心里苦。他忍着，藏着。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:07.28,1:55:11.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That guy's in pain. He sucks it up and hides it.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:11.99,1:55:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全写在脸上了。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:11.99,1:55:14.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's written on his face.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:15.16,1:55:20.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他紧闭着嘴，像闩上的门闩。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:15.16,1:55:20.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He keeps his lips shut tightly, like a bar across a cottage door.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:20.92,1:55:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……试着打开它。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:20.92,1:55:23.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then. . . try to open it.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:30.55,1:55:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在那？！
Dialogue: 1,1:55:30.55,1:55:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who'sthere?!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:31.76,1:55:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:31.76,1:55:33.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Iam.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:35.43,1:55:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:55:35.43,1:55:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything alright?
Dialogue: 2,1:55:44.28,1:55:48.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，你也坐。好吗？咱们聊聊。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:44.28,1:55:48.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, you sit too. Alright? Let's talk a little.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:54.45,1:56:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说说话……对……对你有好处。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:54.45,1:56:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Talking. . . is. . . good for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:01.08,1:56:05.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管多难，说出来就好些。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:01.08,1:56:05.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No matter how hard it gets, talking makes it better.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:08.42,1:56:12.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如，我听说你是个话少的人。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:08.42,1:56:12.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}For instance, I hear you're a man of few words.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:12.68,1:56:17.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我觉得，心里难受，说出来就好。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:12.68,1:56:17.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd say though, if you're hurting, saying so helps.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:19.23,1:56:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，这种时候，聊聊没什么不好。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:19.23,1:56:24.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, at times like these, there's nothing wrong with chatting.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:25.86,1:56:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没什么好说的。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:25.86,1:56:28.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I ain't got nothing to say.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:46.13,1:56:48.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出发吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:46.13,1:56:48.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's head out.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:50.51,1:56:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也去？
Dialogue: 1,1:56:50.51,1:56:51.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Him too?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:51.84,1:56:54.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，孩子需要睡觉。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:51.84,1:56:54.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, a child needs sleep.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:57.89,1:56:59.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃……
Dialogue: 1,1:56:57.89,1:56:59.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino...
Dialogue: 2,1:57:02.15,1:57:05.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他说「志乃」？  -对，「志乃」……
Dialogue: 1,1:57:02.15,1:57:05.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-He said "Shino"?   -Yes, "Shino". . .
Dialogue: 2,1:57:07.15,1:57:08.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女人的名字。
Dialogue: 1,1:57:07.15,1:57:08.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Awoman'sname.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:09.03,1:57:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这孩子，倒挺风流。
Dialogue: 1,1:57:09.03,1:57:12.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}For a child, he sure gets around.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:18.54,1:57:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那，巡逻从哪开始？
Dialogue: 1,1:57:18.54,1:57:21.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, our patrol begins where?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:21.25,1:57:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先，最让人担心的地方。
Dialogue: 1,1:57:21.25,1:57:24.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}First, our greatest source of concern.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:21.85,1:58:23.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在那？！
Dialogue: 1,1:58:21.85,1:58:23.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who'sthere?!
Dialogue: 2,1:58:30.19,1:58:33.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在那？！出来！
Dialogue: 1,1:58:30.19,1:58:33.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's there? ! Come out!
Dialogue: 2,1:58:34.36,1:58:35.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在那？！
Dialogue: 1,1:58:34.36,1:58:35.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who'sthere?!
Dialogue: 2,1:58:35.61,1:58:36.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代。
Dialogue: 1,1:58:35.61,1:58:36.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:39.49,1:58:41.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸好是我们。
Dialogue: 1,1:58:39.49,1:58:41.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Lucky it's us.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:41.95,1:58:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是山贼，你的脑袋……
Dialogue: 1,1:58:41.95,1:58:44.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If we were bandits, your head. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:59:17.24,1:59:18.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:17.24,1:59:18.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yohei.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:19.66,1:59:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:59:19.66,1:59:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's this, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:59:22.04,1:59:24.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我的马，先生。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:22.04,1:59:24.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That'd be my horse, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:26.54,1:59:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看更像只大老鼠。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:26.54,1:59:29.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks more like a big rat to me.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:08.54,2:00:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啾啾，麻雀忠三郎叫
Dialogue: 1,2:00:08.54,2:00:13.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Chu chu, chirps the sparrow called Chuzaburo
Dialogue: 2,2:00:13.46,2:00:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呱呱，乌鸦勘三郎叫
Dialogue: 1,2:00:13.46,2:00:18.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Caw caw, cries the crow called Kanzaburo
Dialogue: 2,2:00:21.60,2:00:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？怎么一个山贼都没见着？
Dialogue: 1,2:00:21.60,2:00:25.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on? Why ain't we seen any bandits?
Dialogue: 2,2:00:27.18,2:00:32.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不来，咱们白请武士白管饭了。
Dialogue: 1,2:00:27.18,2:00:32.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If they don't come, we hired samurai and fed them for nothing.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:32.73,2:00:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笨蛋！他们不来才是好事！
Dialogue: 1,2:00:32.73,2:00:36.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stupid! Them not coming is what we want!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:42.87,2:00:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那瘦马太瘦，骑不了！
Dialogue: 1,2:00:42.87,2:00:46.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That nag's too skinny to ride!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:46.50,2:00:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让这可怜家伙歇歇吧！
Dialogue: 1,2:00:46.50,2:00:48.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let the poor beast rest!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:48.70,2:00:50.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题的！
Dialogue: 1,2:00:48.70,2:00:50.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:51.75,2:00:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代！要是摔断腿，与平会哭的！
Dialogue: 1,2:00:51.75,2:00:55.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo! If it breaks a leg, Yohei'll cry!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:55.13,2:00:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那又怎样？好骑手能让它飞起来！
Dialogue: 1,2:00:55.13,2:00:58.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So what? A good jockey'll make it fly!
Dialogue: 2,2:01:10.89,2:01:12.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还真有两下子。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:10.89,2:01:12.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He's pretty good.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:27.41,2:01:29.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真会耍宝！
Dialogue: 1,2:01:27.41,2:01:29.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What a showman!
Dialogue: 2,2:01:53.69,2:01:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们听着挺高兴。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:53.69,2:01:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They sound cheerful.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:57.32,2:02:00.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收割完了，山贼还没来。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:57.32,2:02:00.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The harvest's done, yet no bandits.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:00.57,2:02:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们可能不来了。都这么说。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:00.57,2:02:03.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They might not come. That's the word.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:04.45,2:02:07.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我倒希望如此……
Dialogue: 1,2:02:04.45,2:02:07.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'd like to think so. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:02:07.91,2:02:13.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可惜，人一松懈，最是脆弱。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:07.91,2:02:13.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Unfortunately, when you're complacent, you're most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:14.58,2:02:16.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫他们回岗位。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:14.58,2:02:16.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Return them to their posts.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:50.83,2:02:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真希望……生为武士之家。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:50.83,2:02:54.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I wish. . . I'd been born to a samurai family.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:57.63,2:03:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}农民太苦了。我这么幸福，都觉得惭愧。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:57.63,2:03:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Peasants have it too hard. I'm so happy, I feel ashamed.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:03.96,2:03:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我是说……
Dialogue: 1,2:03:03.96,2:03:06.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, what I mean is. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:03:06.72,2:03:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是武士，我是农民，所以……
Dialogue: 1,2:03:06.72,2:03:10.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a samurai, and I'm a peasant, so. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:03:10.89,2:03:12.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别说这种话！我……
Dialogue: 1,2:03:10.89,2:03:12.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't say that! I. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:03:12.97,2:03:18.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系！我不在乎。不管等着什么，我都不在乎！
Dialogue: 1,2:03:12.97,2:03:18.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's alright! I don't care. Whatever's waiting, I don't care!
Dialogue: 2,2:03:51.89,2:03:54.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懦夫！拿出武士的样子来！
Dialogue: 1,2:03:51.89,2:03:54.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Weakling! Act like a samurai!
Dialogue: 2,2:05:02.12,2:05:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西边来了三个陌生人。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:02.12,2:05:04.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Three strangers to the west.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:07.34,2:05:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没别人看见？  -没有，还没有。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:07.34,2:05:10.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-No one else saw them?   -No. Not yet.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:10.26,2:05:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能引起恐慌。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:10.26,2:05:12.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We must avoid a panic.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:14.85,2:05:19.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山上！三匹马。肯定是山贼。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:14.85,2:05:19.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The mountain! Three horses. Bandits, surely.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:19.27,2:05:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:19.27,2:05:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Iknow.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:25.48,2:05:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们来了？  -你知道？
Dialogue: 1,2:05:25.48,2:05:27.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-They've come?   -You know?
Dialogue: 2,2:05:27.86,2:05:31.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看他那慌张样，谁都看得出来。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:27.86,2:05:31.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyone could tell, by his jitteriness.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:34.53,2:05:36.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山上？！还是西边？！
Dialogue: 1,2:05:34.53,2:05:36.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The mountain? ! Or the west? !
Dialogue: 2,2:05:39.54,2:05:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西边。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:39.54,2:05:40.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The west. 21035
Dialogue: 2,2:05:49.55,2:05:50.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山贼！
Dialogue: 1,2:05:49.55,2:05:50.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bandits!
Dialogue: 2,2:05:54.93,2:05:58.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让所有人进屋。只有三个山贼。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:54.93,2:05:58.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get everyone inside. Only three bandits.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:58.31,2:06:00.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定要稳住大家。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:58.31,2:06:00.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You must keep everyone calm.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:01.18,2:06:05.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们应该是探子。别让他们看见我们这些武士。
Dialogue: 1,2:06:01.18,2:06:05.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll be scouts. Don't let them see us samurai.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:22.91,2:06:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,2:06:22.91,2:06:24.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 2,2:06:25.42,2:06:26.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山贼？
Dialogue: 1,2:06:25.42,2:06:26.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bandits?
Dialogue: 2,2:06:29.71,2:06:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山贼？在哪儿，啊？
Dialogue: 1,2:06:29.71,2:06:33.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bandits? Where, huh?
Dialogue: 2,2:06:44.60,2:06:46.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别出声。
Dialogue: 1,2:06:44.60,2:06:46.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:47.98,2:06:49.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在哪儿，七郎次？
Dialogue: 1,2:06:47.98,2:06:49.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where, Shichiroji?
Dialogue: 2,2:06:49.98,2:06:51.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那棵杉树那边……
Dialogue: 1,2:06:49.98,2:06:51.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That cedar tree. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:07:07.00,2:07:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是探子。错不了。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:07.00,2:07:09.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Scouts. Unmistakably.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:10.09,2:07:12.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}路障惊到他们了。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:10.09,2:07:12.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The barricade spooked them.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:13.09,2:07:15.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来他们还没发现我们。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:13.09,2:07:15.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Seems they haven't spotted us.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:15.63,2:07:18.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但愿他们只当这里有农民。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:15.63,2:07:18.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hope they only expect peasants.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:20.39,2:07:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！人都哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:20.39,2:07:23.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:23.22,2:07:24.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那蠢货！
Dialogue: 1,2:07:23.22,2:07:24.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That damn fool! 21053
Dialogue: 2,2:07:25.89,2:07:28.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代！菊千代！
Dialogue: 1,2:07:25.89,2:07:28.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo! 31053
Dialogue: 2,2:07:29.73,2:07:31.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来你在这儿。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:29.73,2:07:31.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There you are.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:33.90,2:07:36.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，是山贼吧？你确定……
Dialogue: 1,2:07:33.90,2:07:36.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, bandits huh? You Sure. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:07:38.03,2:07:41.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-蠢货！  -糟了。他们发现你了。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:38.03,2:07:41.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You fool!   -Damn. They noticed you.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:52.13,2:07:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们知道我们在这儿了。不能让他们跑了。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:52.13,2:07:55.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They know we're here. We can't let them escape.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:56.63,2:07:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去。山那边我包了。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:56.63,2:07:59.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I shall go. The mountain is mine.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:59.80,2:08:02.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不知道……  -少废话。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:59.80,2:08:02.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I didn't know. . .   -Save it.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:02.43,2:08:07.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去抓一个回来。就饶了你。听见没？你先去。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:02.43,2:08:07.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go catch one. You'll be forgiven. Alright? You go ahead.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:07.18,2:08:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在马旁边等着。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:07.18,2:08:09.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I shall wait by the horses.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:10.81,2:08:12.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎！
Dialogue: 1,2:08:10.81,2:08:12.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro!
Dialogue: 2,2:08:13.19,2:08:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看好了，听见没？
Dialogue: 1,2:08:13.19,2:08:15.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just watch, you hear me?
Dialogue: 2,2:08:22.78,2:08:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些马真不错！
Dialogue: 1,2:08:22.78,2:08:25.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Those are swell horses!
Dialogue: 2,2:08:29.83,2:08:31.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在下面等着。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:29.83,2:08:31.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait down there.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:40.59,2:08:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你打算怎么办？  -啊？我？
Dialogue: 1,2:08:40.59,2:08:43.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What will you do?   -Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 2,2:10:43.84,2:10:46.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎！胜四郎！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:43.84,2:10:46.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:46.80,2:10:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事了！出来吧！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:46.80,2:10:48.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It is safe! Come out!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:52.31,2:10:53.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饶命！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:52.31,2:10:53.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spare me! 21072
Dialogue: 2,2:10:55.60,2:10:57.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饶命！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:55.60,2:10:57.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spare me! 31072
Dialogue: 2,2:10:59.36,2:11:01.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饶命！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:59.36,2:11:01.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spare me!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:13.12,2:11:14.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:13.12,2:11:14.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:16.00,2:11:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我们的俘虏！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:16.00,2:11:17.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He is our captive!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:18.00,2:11:24.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且他全招了！他在求饶！不能杀他！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:18.00,2:11:24.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Plus, he has confessed! He pleads for his life! You must not kill him!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:25.51,2:11:27.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开，武士！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:25.51,2:11:27.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Back off, samurai!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:28.59,2:11:31.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要杀了他！你这畜生！畜生！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:28.59,2:11:31.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll kill him! You swine! 21078
Dialogue: 2,2:11:32.26,2:11:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:32.26,2:11:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi!31078
Dialogue: 2,2:11:42.78,2:11:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饶命……！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:42.78,2:11:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spare me. . . !
Dialogue: 2,2:11:48.74,2:11:53.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！让她为儿子报仇！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:48.74,2:11:53.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good! Let her avenge her son!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:55.87,2:11:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来人！帮帮她！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:55.87,2:11:58.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody! Help her do it!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:58.67,2:12:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:58.67,2:12:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ishall!21082
Dialogue: 2,2:12:06.55,2:12:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饶命……！
Dialogue: 1,2:12:06.55,2:12:07.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spare me. . . !
Dialogue: 2,2:12:08.38,2:12:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据那个山贼说，他们的老巢……
Dialogue: 1,2:12:08.38,2:12:11.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}According to that bandit, their stronghold. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:12:12.06,2:12:14.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那不算什么堡垒。  -全是漏洞。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:12.06,2:12:14.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-It is no stronghold.   -Full of holes.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:14.93,2:12:16.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟与平的兜裆布似的。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:14.93,2:12:16.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like Yohei's loincloth.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:17.02,2:12:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很容易摸进去。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:17.02,2:12:18.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy to infiltrate.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:18.56,2:12:21.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-夜里去。  -他们有四十匹马。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:18.56,2:12:21.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-At night.   -They have horses.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:21.31,2:12:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先发制人最稳妥。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:21.31,2:12:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Striking first is wisest.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:23.57,2:12:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。前提是我们一个人都不能死。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:23.57,2:12:26.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. Only if none of us is killed.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:26.57,2:12:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们损失不起任何一个人。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:26.57,2:12:28.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't afford to lose one.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:28.95,2:12:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打仗就是要么全赢，要么全输。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:28.95,2:12:30.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}War is all or nothing.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:30.70,2:12:33.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们三个人就能干掉他们十个。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:30.70,2:12:33.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Three of us could kill of them.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:34.83,2:12:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:34.83,2:12:36.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:36.58,2:12:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到鹫峰山脚有多远？
Dialogue: 1,2:12:36.58,2:12:39.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How far to the foot of Washigamine?
Dialogue: 2,2:12:39.71,2:12:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一天的路程。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:39.71,2:12:41.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Aday'sjourney.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:41.42,2:12:44.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有马。那三个山贼的。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:41.42,2:12:44.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We have horses. The three bandits'.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:44.46,2:12:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骑马半天就到。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:44.46,2:12:46.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}By horse, half a day.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:58.85,2:13:03.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧。夜里出发，天亮前能到。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:58.85,2:13:03.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go. If you set off at night, you'll be there before dawn.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:03.73,2:13:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是谁去……
Dialogue: 1,2:13:03.73,2:13:05.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But who will. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:13:08.69,2:13:09.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是你。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:08.69,2:13:09.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Not you.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:12.62,2:13:14.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算我一个。就这么定了。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:12.62,2:13:14.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Plus me. That's that.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:15.74,2:13:17.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有我。他们需要向导。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:15.74,2:13:17.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And me. They need a guide.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:17.87,2:13:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马不够。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:17.87,2:13:19.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ain't enough horses.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:19.83,2:13:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有与平那匹。你骑它。只有你骑得了，菊千代大人。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:19.83,2:13:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There's Yohei's. You ride it. Only you can, Sir Kikuchiyo.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:35.89,2:13:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！走直线！
Dialogue: 1,2:13:35.89,2:13:37.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Go straight!
Dialogue: 2,2:13:38.89,2:13:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边，那边！
Dialogue: 1,2:13:38.89,2:13:40.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thataway, thataway! 21111
Dialogue: 2,2:13:41.14,2:13:43.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}往那边走，你这癞皮狗！
Dialogue: 1,2:13:41.14,2:13:43.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thataway, you fleabag!
Dialogue: 2,2:13:46.02,2:13:47.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我指挥！
Dialogue: 1,2:13:46.02,2:13:47.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Obey my orders!
Dialogue: 2,2:13:47.65,2:13:49.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}往那边走，你这癞皮狗！
Dialogue: 1,2:13:47.65,2:13:49.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thataway, you fleabag!
Dialogue: 2,2:13:51.03,2:13:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也配叫马？！啊？羞不羞！
Dialogue: 1,2:13:51.03,2:13:55.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Call yourself a horse? ! Huh? You oughta be ashamed!
Dialogue: 2,2:13:57.54,2:13:59.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}癞皮狗！等等我！
Dialogue: 1,2:13:57.54,2:13:59.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fleabag! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 2,2:14:01.66,2:14:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快停下！对不起，对不起！
Dialogue: 1,2:14:01.66,2:14:04.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please stop! I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 2,2:14:05.63,2:14:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我道歉！
Dialogue: 1,2:14:05.63,2:14:07.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Iapologize!
Dialogue: 2,2:15:33.76,2:15:36.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！把他们的棚子点着。
Dialogue: 1,2:15:33.76,2:15:36.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Set their shack on fire.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:36.34,2:15:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等他们逃出来就打。
Dialogue: 1,2:15:36.34,2:15:38.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Strike as they flee. 21121
Dialogue: 2,2:18:04.95,2:18:06.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！撤退！
Dialogue: 1,2:18:04.95,2:18:06.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Fall back!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:12.67,2:18:14.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尝尝厉害吧，混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:18:12.67,2:18:14.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Suck on that, bastards!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:15.21,2:18:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干掉他们了！
Dialogue: 1,2:18:15.21,2:18:16.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We got 'em!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:19.30,2:18:21.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尝尝厉害吧，混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:18:19.30,2:18:21.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Suck on that, bastards!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:30.35,2:18:31.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉！
Dialogue: 1,2:18:30.35,2:18:31.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi!41127
Dialogue: 2,2:19:04.76,2:19:06.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}平八！平八！
Dialogue: 1,2:19:04.76,2:19:06.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Heihachi!
Dialogue: 2,2:19:26.24,2:19:28.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蠢货！你疯了吗？！
Dialogue: 1,2:19:26.24,2:19:28.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbass! You outta your mind? !
Dialogue: 2,2:19:43.30,2:19:49.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蠢货！差点害死我们！那疯女人是谁？！
Dialogue: 1,2:19:43.30,2:19:49.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbass! You nearly got us killed! Who was that crazy bitch? !
Dialogue: 2,2:19:50.68,2:19:52.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……老婆！
Dialogue: 1,2:19:50.68,2:19:52.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My...wife!
Dialogue: 2,2:19:55.68,2:19:57.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}平八！平八！
Dialogue: 1,2:19:55.68,2:19:57.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Heihachi!
Dialogue: 2,2:19:57.94,2:20:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撑住！喂，平八！
Dialogue: 1,2:19:57.94,2:20:00.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Be strong! Hey, Heihachi!
Dialogue: 2,2:20:38.60,2:20:39.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说过……
Dialogue: 1,2:20:38.60,2:20:39.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You said. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:20:42.19,2:20:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他在艰难时能派上大用场。
Dialogue: 1,2:20:42.19,2:20:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}. . . e would be invaluable in tough times.
Dialogue: 2,2:20:46.99,2:20:49.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在往后只会更难。
Dialogue: 1,2:20:46.99,2:20:49.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It will only get tougher now.
Dialogue: 2,2:20:59.58,2:21:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别哭了！
Dialogue: 1,2:20:59.58,2:21:00.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Quit crying!
Dialogue: 2,2:21:01.58,2:21:03.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别哭了，蠢货！
Dialogue: 1,2:21:01.58,2:21:03.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Quit crying, dumbass!
Dialogue: 2,2:21:04.88,2:21:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别哭了！
Dialogue: 1,2:21:04.88,2:21:06.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Quit crying! 21141
Dialogue: 2,2:21:07.76,2:21:10.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别哭了，混蛋！别哭了！
Dialogue: 1,2:21:07.76,2:21:10.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Quit crying, dammit! Quit it!
Dialogue: 2,2:22:34.43,2:22:36.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些混蛋来了！
Dialogue: 1,2:22:34.43,2:22:36.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here those bastards come!
Dialogue: 2,2:23:46.67,2:23:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！分头行动！
Dialogue: 1,2:23:46.67,2:23:48.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Let's split up!
Dialogue: 2,2:23:49.75,2:23:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我看到……三支火枪。
Dialogue: 1,2:23:49.75,2:23:53.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen. I see. . . three matchlocks.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:19.53,2:24:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}北边二十个，南边十三个。
Dialogue: 1,2:24:19.53,2:24:21.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}20 to the north, to the south.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:22.08,2:24:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-火枪？  -一共三支！
Dialogue: 1,2:24:22.08,2:24:24.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Matchlocks?   -Three altogether!
Dialogue: 2,2:24:25.41,2:24:28.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盯住南边，别中枪。
Dialogue: 1,2:24:25.41,2:24:28.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch the south. Don't get shot.
Dialogue: 2,2:25:24.64,2:25:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撤退！撤退！撤退！
Dialogue: 1,2:25:24.64,2:25:26.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Retreat!
Dialogue: 2,2:25:42.53,2:25:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-南边十二个往东去了。  -什么？不是十三个？
Dialogue: 1,2:25:42.53,2:25:46.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-from the south are eastbound.   -What? Not 13?
Dialogue: 2,2:25:46.37,2:25:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一箭射死了一个。
Dialogue: 1,2:25:46.37,2:25:48.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}An arrow got one.
Dialogue: 2,2:25:48.66,2:25:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不愧是五郎兵卫。
Dialogue: 1,2:25:48.66,2:25:50.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good old Gorobei.
Dialogue: 2,2:25:52.79,2:25:56.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎，东边。桥那边，还有……
Dialogue: 1,2:25:52.79,2:25:56.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro, the east. The bridge, and. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:25:56.30,2:25:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火枪！
Dialogue: 1,2:25:56.30,2:25:57.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Matchlocks!
Dialogue: 2,2:26:06.89,2:26:10.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去看看北边，山头是关键。
Dialogue: 1,2:26:06.89,2:26:10.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Check the north. The mountain is crucial.
Dialogue: 2,2:26:11.31,2:26:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那先生，为什么不在那儿筑栅栏？
Dialogue: 1,2:26:11.31,2:26:14.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then sir, why not build barricades there?
Dialogue: 2,2:26:15.06,2:26:17.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好城堡得留个弱点。
Dialogue: 1,2:26:15.06,2:26:17.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A good castle has a weak point.
Dialogue: 2,2:26:17.69,2:26:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了把敌人引进来。光防守不够。
Dialogue: 1,2:26:17.69,2:26:21.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}To draw in the enemy. Defense alone is not enough.
Dialogue: 2,2:26:33.58,2:26:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加把劲！
Dialogue: 1,2:26:33.58,2:26:35.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Put your backs into it!
Dialogue: 2,2:26:39.96,2:26:41.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搬走！
Dialogue: 1,2:26:39.96,2:26:41.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take it away!
Dialogue: 2,2:26:46.09,2:26:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十二个骑马的！桥那边……
Dialogue: 1,2:26:46.09,2:26:48.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}12 men on horses! The bridge. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:26:48.97,2:26:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你瞎了吗？我们正在弄！
Dialogue: 1,2:26:48.97,2:26:51.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you blind? We're doing it!
Dialogue: 2,2:26:53.60,2:26:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，当心火枪。
Dialogue: 1,2:26:53.60,2:26:55.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Also, beware of matchlocks.
Dialogue: 2,2:26:56.10,2:26:57.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:26:56.10,2:26:57.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, dammit!
Dialogue: 2,2:27:04.61,2:27:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！去哪儿？！
Dialogue: 1,2:27:04.61,2:27:06.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Where to? !
Dialogue: 2,2:27:06.24,2:27:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我到处都找不到我爹！
Dialogue: 1,2:27:06.24,2:27:08.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't find my father anywhere!
Dialogue: 2,2:27:09.58,2:27:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他想死在那间小屋里！听着水车声！
Dialogue: 1,2:27:09.58,2:27:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He wants to die in that hut! Listening to the mill!
Dialogue: 2,2:27:19.75,2:27:21.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这老顽固！
Dialogue: 1,2:27:19.75,2:27:21.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn stubborn old coot!
Dialogue: 2,2:27:22.38,2:27:24.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快去把他拉来！
Dialogue: 1,2:27:22.38,2:27:24.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry up and get him!
Dialogue: 2,2:27:28.09,2:27:30.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？快点儿！
Dialogue: 1,2:27:28.09,2:27:30.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Move your ass!
Dialogue: 2,2:27:31.26,2:27:34.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！快点儿！给我过来，混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:27:31.26,2:27:34.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hurry it up! Get over here, dammit!
Dialogue: 2,2:27:56.42,2:27:58.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-山上……  -二十匹马。
Dialogue: 1,2:27:56.42,2:27:58.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-The mountain. . .   -horses.
Dialogue: 2,2:27:59.13,2:28:01.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}东边十二个？
Dialogue: 1,2:27:59.13,2:28:01.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And to the east?
Dialogue: 2,2:28:19.06,2:28:22.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不行，他们都吓坏了。
Dialogue: 1,2:28:19.06,2:28:22.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is no good. They are all scared.
Dialogue: 2,2:28:25.94,2:28:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！再来！
Dialogue: 1,2:28:25.94,2:28:27.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good! Again!
Dialogue: 2,2:28:29.32,2:28:30.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来！
Dialogue: 1,2:28:29.32,2:28:30.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Again!
Dialogue: 2,2:28:34.08,2:28:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是七郎次！我们也照做！
Dialogue: 1,2:28:34.08,2:28:37.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's Shichiroji! Let's do the same!
Dialogue: 2,2:28:38.92,2:28:40.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来！
Dialogue: 1,2:28:38.92,2:28:40.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out!
Dialogue: 2,2:28:45.80,2:28:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}举起长矛，喊起来。
Dialogue: 1,2:28:45.80,2:28:48.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Raise your spears and yell.
Dialogue: 2,2:28:53.22,2:28:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来！
Dialogue: 1,2:28:53.22,2:28:54.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Again!
Dialogue: 2,2:28:57.93,2:29:00.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们想显摆？咱也显摆给他们看！
Dialogue: 1,2:28:57.93,2:29:00.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They wanna show off? We'll show 'em!
Dialogue: 2,2:29:04.86,2:29:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平！你老糊涂了吗？！再来！
Dialogue: 1,2:29:04.86,2:29:07.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yohei! You gone senile? ! Again!
Dialogue: 2,2:29:12.87,2:29:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都起来！
Dialogue: 1,2:29:12.87,2:29:14.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody up!
Dialogue: 2,2:29:19.58,2:29:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们来了！
Dialogue: 1,2:29:19.58,2:29:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here they come!
Dialogue: 2,2:29:38.22,2:29:39.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋。
Dialogue: 1,2:29:38.22,2:29:39.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastards.
Dialogue: 2,2:29:55.53,2:29:57.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好险……
Dialogue: 1,2:29:55.53,2:29:57.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That was close. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:30:15.76,2:30:18.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！与平！你不能去！
Dialogue: 1,2:30:15.76,2:30:18.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Yohei! You ain't going! 21197
Dialogue: 2,2:30:23.31,2:30:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别昏了头！
Dialogue: 1,2:30:23.31,2:30:25.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't lose your damn head!
Dialogue: 2,2:30:30.32,2:30:31.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静！冷静！
Dialogue: 1,2:30:30.32,2:30:31.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay calm! Calm! 21198
Dialogue: 2,2:30:34.82,2:30:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:30:34.82,2:30:36.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastards!31198
Dialogue: 2,2:30:40.33,2:30:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去你的！
Dialogue: 1,2:30:40.33,2:30:41.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw you!
Dialogue: 2,2:30:46.17,2:30:48.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！他们放火了！
Dialogue: 1,2:30:46.17,2:30:48.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! They're burning! 21199
Dialogue: 2,2:30:49.21,2:30:50.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！
Dialogue: 1,2:30:49.21,2:30:50.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dammit!
Dialogue: 2,2:31:20.87,2:31:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退回去！大家都退回去！
Dialogue: 1,2:31:20.87,2:31:23.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back! Everybody get back! 21200
Dialogue: 2,2:31:25.12,2:31:26.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当家的！当家的……
Dialogue: 1,2:31:25.12,2:31:26.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Husband! Husband. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:31:28.71,2:31:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别管了！别管那些破屋子！
Dialogue: 1,2:31:28.71,2:31:31.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Forget 'em! Forget those hovels!
Dialogue: 2,2:31:34.22,2:31:37.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家回自己的位置！
Dialogue: 1,2:31:34.22,2:31:37.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody, back to your posts!
Dialogue: 2,2:31:48.65,2:31:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:31:48.65,2:31:49.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastards!
Dialogue: 2,2:31:51.98,2:31:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这帮野狗！
Dialogue: 1,2:31:51.98,2:31:53.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dirty mongrels!
Dialogue: 2,2:31:54.11,2:31:56.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！老爷子的房子！
Dialogue: 1,2:31:54.11,2:31:56.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! The elder's house!
Dialogue: 2,2:31:59.16,2:32:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在那儿吗？！跟那对夫妻一起？！
Dialogue: 1,2:31:59.16,2:32:02.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is he there? ! With that couple? !
Dialogue: 2,2:32:02.41,2:32:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连孩子也在？！该死！他们疯了吗！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:02.41,2:32:06.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The kid too? ! Dammit! They gotta be crazy!
Dialogue: 2,2:32:08.54,2:32:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}站住！别擅离岗位！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:08.54,2:32:11.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! Don't abandon your post!
Dialogue: 2,2:32:13.42,2:32:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代！退回来！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:13.42,2:32:15.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo! Fall back! 21211
Dialogue: 2,2:32:17.51,2:32:19.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代！菊千代！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:17.51,2:32:19.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo! 31211
Dialogue: 2,2:32:20.55,2:32:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代！菊千代！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:20.55,2:32:22.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo!
Dialogue: 2,2:32:34.19,2:32:36.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老爷子？！你男人？！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:34.19,2:32:36.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The elder? ! Your hubby? ! 21212
Dialogue: 2,2:32:42.20,2:32:43.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂、喂！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:42.20,2:32:43.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}H-Hey!
Dialogue: 2,2:32:47.04,2:32:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}枪伤。她竟然撑到这儿！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:47.04,2:32:49.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spear wound. She made it so far!
Dialogue: 2,2:32:56.46,2:32:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代！退回来！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:56.46,2:32:58.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo! Fall back!
Dialogue: 2,2:32:59.97,2:33:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退回来！
Dialogue: 1,2:32:59.97,2:33:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fall back!
Dialogue: 2,2:33:04.85,2:33:06.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了？！
Dialogue: 1,2:33:04.85,2:33:06.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong with you? !
Dialogue: 2,2:33:10.23,2:33:12.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这孩子……就是我！
Dialogue: 1,2:33:10.23,2:33:12.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This kid. . . is me!
Dialogue: 2,2:33:13.36,2:33:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也经历过这种事！
Dialogue: 1,2:33:13.36,2:33:15.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This happened to me too!
Dialogue: 2,2:34:24.68,2:34:26.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打起来了！
Dialogue: 1,2:34:24.68,2:34:26.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's on now! 21220
Dialogue: 2,2:34:29.52,2:34:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,2:34:29.52,2:34:30.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?31220
Dialogue: 2,2:34:35.31,2:34:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么，什么？啊？
Dialogue: 1,2:34:35.31,2:34:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What, what? Huh?
Dialogue: 2,2:34:40.90,2:34:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，就这样？
Dialogue: 1,2:34:40.90,2:34:42.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, is that all? 21221
Dialogue: 2,2:34:45.66,2:34:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人渣。
Dialogue: 1,2:34:45.66,2:34:47.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Scum.
Dialogue: 2,2:34:51.70,2:34:54.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让他闯过去了？啊？
Dialogue: 1,2:34:51.70,2:34:54.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You let him get past you? Huh?
Dialogue: 2,2:34:55.33,2:34:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蠢货！
Dialogue: 1,2:34:55.33,2:34:56.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbass!21223
Dialogue: 2,2:35:08.68,2:35:09.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进攻！
Dialogue: 1,2:35:08.68,2:35:09.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Attack!
Dialogue: 2,2:35:59.27,2:36:01.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！有人受伤吗？！
Dialogue: 1,2:35:59.27,2:36:01.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Anyone hurt? !
Dialogue: 2,2:36:01.78,2:36:05.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！干得好！干得好！
Dialogue: 1,2:36:01.78,2:36:05.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good! Well done!
Dialogue: 2,2:36:09.41,2:36:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我闻到火药味了。跑！快跑！
Dialogue: 1,2:36:09.41,2:36:11.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I smell gunpowder. Run!
Dialogue: 2,2:36:22.17,2:36:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万造！万造！万造！
Dialogue: 1,2:36:22.17,2:36:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Manzo!
Dialogue: 2,2:36:30.05,2:36:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挺住！万造！挺住！挺住！
Dialogue: 1,2:36:30.05,2:36:33.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Be strong! Manzo!
Dialogue: 2,2:36:37.68,2:36:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪儿？让我看看！
Dialogue: 1,2:36:37.68,2:36:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where? Show me!
Dialogue: 2,2:36:40.15,2:36:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！志乃！去叫我女儿！
Dialogue: 1,2:36:40.15,2:36:43.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino! Get my daughter!
Dialogue: 2,2:36:44.07,2:36:45.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不用了。
Dialogue: 1,2:36:44.07,2:36:45.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no need.
Dialogue: 2,2:36:46.28,2:36:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这要是能要你的命，跳蚤也能。
Dialogue: 1,2:36:46.28,2:36:49.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If this'd kill you, so would a flea.
Dialogue: 2,2:36:50.41,2:36:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，为这点伤大呼小叫，
Dialogue: 1,2:36:50.41,2:36:52.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, make a fuss over this,
Dialogue: 2,2:36:53.08,2:36:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就把你女儿的伪装给揭穿了。
Dialogue: 1,2:36:53.08,2:36:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and you'll ruin your daughter's disguise.
Dialogue: 2,2:37:26.36,2:37:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别追了！够了！
Dialogue: 1,2:37:26.36,2:37:28.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't give chase! Enough!
Dialogue: 2,2:37:32.12,2:37:33.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，干得好！
Dialogue: 1,2:37:32.12,2:37:33.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. Well done!
Dialogue: 2,2:37:34.95,2:37:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}报上名来！
Dialogue: 1,2:37:34.95,2:37:36.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Say your name!
Dialogue: 2,2:37:38.75,2:37:40.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利吉！
Dialogue: 1,2:37:38.75,2:37:40.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rikichi!
Dialogue: 2,2:37:55.39,2:37:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}东边、西边、南边。
Dialogue: 1,2:37:55.39,2:37:57.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}East, west, south.
Dialogue: 2,2:37:58.14,2:38:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们试探了一下，就溜了。
Dialogue: 1,2:37:58.14,2:38:01.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They tested us, then scurried off.
Dialogue: 2,2:38:01.39,2:38:03.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就只剩这条路了。
Dialogue: 1,2:38:01.39,2:38:03.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That leaves this way.
Dialogue: 2,2:38:03.15,2:38:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚他们也许不会进攻，
Dialogue: 1,2:38:03.15,2:38:05.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They may not attack tonight,
Dialogue: 2,2:38:06.02,2:38:08.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他们会盯上这里。
Dialogue: 1,2:38:06.02,2:38:08.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but they'll focus on here.
Dialogue: 2,2:38:08.23,2:38:09.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是，先生……
Dialogue: 1,2:38:08.23,2:38:09.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But sir. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:38:10.78,2:38:12.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听不见他们。
Dialogue: 1,2:38:10.78,2:38:12.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't hear them.
Dialogue: 2,2:38:25.88,2:38:30.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算这样……他们也会集中攻打这里。
Dialogue: 1,2:38:25.88,2:38:30.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Even so. . . they'll focus their attack here.
Dialogue: 2,2:38:31.13,2:38:33.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会证明给你看。
Dialogue: 1,2:38:31.13,2:38:33.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll prove it to you. 21252
Dialogue: 2,2:38:45.02,2:38:46.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别出去！
Dialogue: 1,2:38:45.02,2:38:46.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't go out!
Dialogue: 2,2:39:17.09,2:39:21.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好。把这个稻草人插到那棵树上。
Dialogue: 1,2:39:17.09,2:39:21.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good work. Stick this scarecrow out from that tree.
Dialogue: 2,2:39:56.09,2:40:02.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，我看明天早上，他们会试着从这里突破。
Dialogue: 1,2:39:56.09,2:40:02.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I'd say tomorrow morning, they'll try to push through here.
Dialogue: 2,2:40:02.14,2:40:05.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后，我们放他们进村。
Dialogue: 1,2:40:02.14,2:40:05.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then, we let them in the village.
Dialogue: 2,2:40:09.15,2:40:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如说，我们只放一个骑马的进来。
Dialogue: 1,2:40:09.15,2:40:12.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Rather, we'll let in one on horseback.
Dialogue: 2,2:40:13.28,2:40:14.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最多两个。
Dialogue: 1,2:40:13.28,2:40:14.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Two at most.
Dialogue: 2,2:40:15.74,2:40:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们一进来，我们就用长矛堵住路。
Dialogue: 1,2:40:15.74,2:40:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Once they're in, we'll block the road with spears.
Dialogue: 2,2:40:20.66,2:40:25.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们就成了笼中之鼠，随我们处置。
Dialogue: 1,2:40:20.66,2:40:25.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll be rats in a cage. To be dealt with as we wish.
Dialogue: 2,2:40:28.00,2:40:32.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一个个干掉他们，然后就拼死一搏。
Dialogue: 1,2:40:28.00,2:40:32.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll take them down one by one, then it's do or die.
Dialogue: 2,2:40:32.42,2:40:36.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火绳枪是个麻烦。要是能干掉一个……
Dialogue: 1,2:40:32.42,2:40:36.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Matchlocks are a concern. If we take out one. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:40:39.68,2:40:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去夺一支。我保证！
Dialogue: 1,2:40:39.68,2:40:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll get one. I promise you I will!
Dialogue: 2,2:40:42.68,2:40:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。你是想死。我去。
Dialogue: 1,2:40:42.68,2:40:46.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. You wish to die. I shall go. 21272
Dialogue: 2,2:40:51.69,2:40:54.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎！隐蔽！
Dialogue: 1,2:40:51.69,2:40:54.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro! Take cover!
Dialogue: 2,2:41:39.49,2:41:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脚步声！你听！
Dialogue: 1,2:41:39.49,2:41:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Footsteps! Listen!
Dialogue: 2,2:41:41.49,2:41:44.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎，够了。去歇会儿。
Dialogue: 1,2:41:41.49,2:41:44.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro, enough. Get some rest.
Dialogue: 2,2:41:44.83,2:41:47.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是真的！我听见了！你听！
Dialogue: 1,2:41:44.83,2:41:47.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They're real! I hear them! Listen!
Dialogue: 2,2:41:48.00,2:41:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说够了。
Dialogue: 1,2:41:48.00,2:41:50.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Enough, I said.
Dialogue: 2,2:41:51.12,2:41:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你累了。休息吧。
Dialogue: 1,2:41:51.12,2:41:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're tired. Rest now.
Dialogue: 2,2:41:56.88,2:41:58.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听见了！
Dialogue: 1,2:41:56.88,2:41:58.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I hear them!
Dialogue: 2,2:42:26.78,2:42:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干掉两个。
Dialogue: 1,2:42:26.78,2:42:28.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Two down.
Dialogue: 2,2:43:03.57,2:43:04.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,2:43:03.57,2:43:04.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 2,2:43:07.91,2:43:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有话快说。我要睡觉。
Dialogue: 1,2:43:07.91,2:43:11.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Say your piece. I need to sleep.
Dialogue: 2,2:43:13.41,2:43:16.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是……了不起。
Dialogue: 1,2:43:13.41,2:43:16.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You are. . . truly amazing.
Dialogue: 2,2:43:21.30,2:43:25.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……一直想跟你说这个。
Dialogue: 1,2:43:21.30,2:43:25.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've. . . been wanting to tell you that.
Dialogue: 2,2:43:51.33,2:43:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们来了！
Dialogue: 1,2:43:51.33,2:43:52.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They have come!
Dialogue: 2,2:43:57.21,2:43:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放一个过来！
Dialogue: 1,2:43:57.21,2:43:58.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let one through!
Dialogue: 2,2:44:00.50,2:44:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！我们放一个过去！
Dialogue: 1,2:44:00.50,2:44:03.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! We're letting one through!
Dialogue: 2,2:44:11.39,2:44:15.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住，放进来之后就用长矛堵住路！
Dialogue: 1,2:44:11.39,2:44:15.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember, once it's through, block the road with spears!
Dialogue: 2,2:44:33.74,2:44:35.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了，他们来了……
Dialogue: 1,2:44:33.74,2:44:35.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no, they're here. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:45:11.95,2:45:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！
Dialogue: 1,2:45:11.95,2:45:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back!
Dialogue: 2,2:45:16.29,2:45:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。
Dialogue: 1,2:45:16.29,2:45:17.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 2,2:45:25.59,2:45:28.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你发什么呆？干得好！
Dialogue: 1,2:45:25.59,2:45:28.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you dazed? You did well!
Dialogue: 2,2:45:29.22,2:45:30.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又一个！撤退！
Dialogue: 1,2:45:29.22,2:45:30.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Another! Fall back! 21296
Dialogue: 2,2:45:48.61,2:45:50.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撤退！撤退！
Dialogue: 1,2:45:48.61,2:45:50.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Retreat!
Dialogue: 2,2:45:55.12,2:45:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向后转！
Dialogue: 1,2:45:55.12,2:45:56.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}About-turn!
Dialogue: 2,2:45:56.49,2:45:58.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！冲啊！
Dialogue: 1,2:45:56.49,2:45:58.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Charge!
Dialogue: 2,2:46:05.13,2:46:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！再放一个进来！
Dialogue: 1,2:46:05.13,2:46:08.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! We'll let another through! 21299
Dialogue: 2,2:46:27.27,2:46:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎！
Dialogue: 1,2:46:27.27,2:46:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro!31299
Dialogue: 2,2:46:31.28,2:46:32.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}追！
Dialogue: 1,2:46:31.28,2:46:32.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Chase them!
Dialogue: 2,2:46:47.00,2:46:48.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊，有种就来！
Dialogue: 1,2:46:47.00,2:46:48.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come and get it!
Dialogue: 2,2:47:49.48,2:47:51.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！放马过来！
Dialogue: 1,2:47:49.48,2:47:51.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! Bring it on! 21301
Dialogue: 2,2:48:05.71,2:48:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看这个！
Dialogue: 1,2:48:05.71,2:48:06.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Lookee here!
Dialogue: 2,2:48:08.21,2:48:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无价之宝！你们看！
Dialogue: 1,2:48:08.21,2:48:10.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Priceless! You guys, watch!
Dialogue: 2,2:48:16.51,2:48:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂。你搞什么鬼？醒醒！
Dialogue: 1,2:48:16.51,2:48:20.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. What were you playing at? Wake up!
Dialogue: 2,2:48:41.03,2:48:44.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有了。一朝被蛇咬，十年怕井绳？
Dialogue: 1,2:48:41.03,2:48:44.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No more. Once bitten, twice shy?
Dialogue: 2,2:48:54.38,2:48:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全是胆小鬼。好对付。
Dialogue: 1,2:48:54.38,2:48:57.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They're all yellowbellies. Easy pickings.
Dialogue: 2,2:49:04.56,2:49:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那几场小打小闹干掉了四个。昨晚久藏干掉两个。
Dialogue: 1,2:49:04.56,2:49:09.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Those skirmishes took down four. Kyuzo got two last night.
Dialogue: 2,2:49:26.45,2:49:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那人才是真正的武士。
Dialogue: 1,2:49:26.45,2:49:28.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That man's a true samurai.
Dialogue: 2,2:49:29.04,2:49:33.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胆大，身手极好，心地也善良。
Dialogue: 1,2:49:29.04,2:49:33.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Daring, and supremely skilled. Kindhearted too.
Dialogue: 2,2:49:33.67,2:49:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，他从不吹嘘那支火绳枪。
Dialogue: 1,2:49:33.67,2:49:37.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Plus, he never bragged about the matchlock.
Dialogue: 2,2:49:37.72,2:49:42.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他闯进险境，就像去采蘑菇一样。
Dialogue: 1,2:49:37.72,2:49:42.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He headed into danger as if he was going to pick mushrooms.
Dialogue: 2,2:49:43.72,2:49:48.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小子，你真有意思。我听多久都不腻。
Dialogue: 1,2:49:43.72,2:49:48.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Boy, you're entertaining. I never get sick of listening.
Dialogue: 2,2:50:05.95,2:50:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，与平。
Dialogue: 1,2:50:05.95,2:50:07.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Yohei.
Dialogue: 2,2:50:08.58,2:50:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里交给你。
Dialogue: 1,2:50:08.58,2:50:10.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're in charge.
Dialogue: 2,2:50:13.25,2:50:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你哭什么？你现在完全应付得来。
Dialogue: 1,2:50:13.25,2:50:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Why are you whimpering? You can handle it fine now.
Dialogue: 2,2:50:20.34,2:50:22.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个完美的稻草人。
Dialogue: 1,2:50:20.34,2:50:22.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A perfect scarecrow.
Dialogue: 2,2:51:53.93,2:51:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都听好了！你们谁想溜……
Dialogue: 1,2:51:53.93,2:51:58.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen up! If any of you want to weasel out. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:52:04.86,2:52:05.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！
Dialogue: 1,2:52:04.86,2:52:05.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Move!
Dialogue: 2,2:53:34.70,2:53:35.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样了？
Dialogue: 1,2:53:34.70,2:53:35.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How's it going?
Dialogue: 2,2:53:36.08,2:53:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这帮家伙真让人头疼。
Dialogue: 1,2:53:36.08,2:53:38.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They're a damn headache.
Dialogue: 2,2:53:38.41,2:53:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，也撑不了多久了。
Dialogue: 1,2:53:38.41,2:53:40.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, not for much longer.
Dialogue: 2,2:53:40.96,2:53:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是啊，这事全乱套了。
Dialogue: 1,2:53:40.96,2:53:44.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But hey, this is all topsy-turvy.
Dialogue: 2,2:53:44.46,2:53:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把我们烧光了。我们只能喝水充饥。
Dialogue: 1,2:53:44.46,2:53:48.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They burned us out. All we got to eat is water.
Dialogue: 2,2:53:48.97,2:53:51.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别抱怨了。你的苦日子快到头了。
Dialogue: 1,2:53:48.97,2:53:51.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't grumble. Your agony's gonna end.
Dialogue: 2,2:53:52.05,2:53:54.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就拜托了，兄弟。
Dialogue: 1,2:53:52.05,2:53:54.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Make it so, buddy.
Dialogue: 2,2:54:34.09,2:54:35.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我，是我！
Dialogue: 1,2:54:34.09,2:54:35.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's me, it's me!
Dialogue: 2,2:54:43.48,2:54:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尝尝这个，你们这帮野狗！
Dialogue: 1,2:54:43.48,2:54:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Suck on that, mongrels!
Dialogue: 2,2:54:45.48,2:54:46.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个蠢货！
Dialogue: 1,2:54:45.48,2:54:46.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You fool!
Dialogue: 2,2:54:47.61,2:54:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么擅离职守？！
Dialogue: 1,2:54:47.61,2:54:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why desert your post? !
Dialogue: 2,2:54:49.78,2:54:53.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看我拿到了什么？我可没做错事。
Dialogue: 1,2:54:49.78,2:54:53.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}See what I got? I done nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 2,2:54:53.40,2:54:55.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的岗位没事。
Dialogue: 1,2:54:53.40,2:54:55.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My post's fine.
Dialogue: 2,2:54:55.99,2:54:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}军纪重于战功！
Dialogue: 1,2:54:55.99,2:54:58.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Discipline over glory!
Dialogue: 2,2:54:59.54,2:55:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我听清楚。仗不是一个人打赢的！
Dialogue: 1,2:54:59.54,2:55:03.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get this straight. Battles aren't won alone!
Dialogue: 2,2:55:14.05,2:55:17.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五郎兵卫！久藏！守在这里！明白吗？！
Dialogue: 1,2:55:14.05,2:55:17.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Gorobei! Kyuzo! Stay here! Got it? !
Dialogue: 2,2:55:22.52,2:55:24.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个人都不许放进来！
Dialogue: 1,2:55:22.52,2:55:24.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let no man through! 21339
Dialogue: 2,2:56:40.97,2:56:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撤退！撤退！
Dialogue: 1,2:56:40.97,2:56:43.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fall back!
Dialogue: 2,2:57:01.16,2:57:02.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:01.16,2:57:02.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastard!21340
Dialogue: 2,2:57:25.68,2:57:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！你们这帮混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:25.68,2:57:27.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! You bastards!
Dialogue: 2,2:57:32.90,2:57:35.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！给我回来，混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:32.90,2:57:35.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Come back here, bastards!
Dialogue: 2,2:57:35.82,2:57:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗娘养的！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:35.82,2:57:37.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 2,2:57:37.57,2:57:39.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了！进来两个！跟我来！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:37.57,2:57:39.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no! Two got in! With me!
Dialogue: 2,2:57:40.32,2:57:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:40.32,2:57:41.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dammit!21344
Dialogue: 2,2:57:44.53,2:57:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:44.53,2:57:45.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!31344
Dialogue: 2,2:57:54.34,2:57:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！可恶！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:54.34,2:57:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Damn!
Dialogue: 2,2:57:57.84,2:58:00.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！与平到底在哪？！
Dialogue: 1,2:57:57.84,2:58:00.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dammit! Where the hell is Yohei? !
Dialogue: 2,2:58:41.13,2:58:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平！
Dialogue: 1,2:58:41.13,2:58:42.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yohei!21346
Dialogue: 2,2:58:44.09,2:58:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与平！喂！
Dialogue: 1,2:58:44.09,2:58:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yohei! Hey!
Dialogue: 2,2:58:45.97,2:58:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我照你说的守着……
Dialogue: 1,2:58:45.97,2:58:48.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I kept watch like you said. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:58:48.89,2:58:51.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}振作点！与平！
Dialogue: 1,2:58:48.89,2:58:51.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get a grip! Yohei! 21348
Dialogue: 2,2:58:55.36,2:58:57.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}站住！站住！
Dialogue: 1,2:58:55.36,2:58:57.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop right there! Stop!
Dialogue: 2,2:59:35.19,2:59:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}七郎次，接手！
Dialogue: 1,2:59:35.19,2:59:36.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shichiroji, take over!
Dialogue: 2,2:59:48.20,2:59:49.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！五郎兵卫！
Dialogue: 1,2:59:48.20,2:59:49.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Gorobei! 21350
Dialogue: 2,2:59:59.79,3:00:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五郎兵卫！五郎兵卫！
Dialogue: 1,2:59:59.79,3:00:01.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Gorobei!
Dialogue: 2,3:00:53.85,3:00:55.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们还剩十三个人。
Dialogue: 1,3:00:53.85,3:00:55.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They have left.
Dialogue: 2,3:00:56.64,3:01:01.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可最后这七个……代价太大了。
Dialogue: 1,3:00:56.64,3:01:01.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But these last seven. . . came at a great cost.
Dialogue: 2,3:01:23.30,3:01:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么样？累吗？
Dialogue: 1,3:01:23.30,3:01:25.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How are you? Tired?
Dialogue: 2,3:01:27.80,3:01:32.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可怜的人。你瘦多了，先生，不是吗？
Dialogue: 1,3:01:27.80,3:01:32.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You poor man. You look much thinner, mister. No?
Dialogue: 2,3:01:35.93,3:01:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去洗把脸。
Dialogue: 1,3:01:35.93,3:01:38.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll go wash my face.
Dialogue: 2,3:01:48.94,3:01:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后决战临近了。
Dialogue: 1,3:01:48.94,3:01:51.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our last stand approaches.
Dialogue: 2,3:01:51.91,3:01:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有力气才能打啊。
Dialogue: 1,3:01:51.91,3:01:56.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We can only fight if we still have the energy.
Dialogue: 2,3:01:56.45,3:01:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，要是他们来攻……
Dialogue: 1,3:01:56.45,3:01:59.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}However, if they do attack. . .
Dialogue: 2,3:02:01.29,3:02:06.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们也累了，还有伤。今晚不会来。
Dialogue: 1,3:02:01.29,3:02:06.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They're tired as well. And injured. They won't come tonight.
Dialogue: 2,3:02:07.09,3:02:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最重要的是，他们缺粮，内部也开始闹起来了。
Dialogue: 1,3:02:07.09,3:02:12.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Most importantly, they lack food, and infighting has begun.
Dialogue: 2,3:02:13.18,3:02:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们等不起。
Dialogue: 1,3:02:13.18,3:02:15.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They cannot afford to wait.
Dialogue: 2,3:02:15.60,3:02:21.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多半明天一早，他们会拼命扑过来。
Dialogue: 1,3:02:15.60,3:02:21.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Most likely, tomorrow morning, they'll come at us in a frenzy.
Dialogue: 2,3:02:23.10,3:02:25.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎。胜四郎！
Dialogue: 1,3:02:23.10,3:02:25.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro. Katsushiro!
Dialogue: 2,3:02:44.38,3:02:45.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来传令。
Dialogue: 1,3:02:44.38,3:02:45.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I bring orders.
Dialogue: 2,3:02:45.84,3:02:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派两个哨兵，其余人睡觉。
Dialogue: 1,3:02:45.84,3:02:49.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Assign two lookouts. Let the rest sleep.
Dialogue: 2,3:02:49.76,3:02:53.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，准许家人探视，一次一个人。
Dialogue: 1,3:02:49.76,3:02:53.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Also, allow family visits, sending one at a time.
Dialogue: 2,3:02:55.47,3:02:57.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天决战？
Dialogue: 1,3:02:55.47,3:02:57.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomorrow's the showdown?
Dialogue: 2,3:02:59.22,3:03:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是。命令就是这样。
Dialogue: 1,3:02:59.22,3:03:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Those are the orders.
Dialogue: 2,3:03:08.11,3:03:11.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大伙儿，都听见了吧？
Dialogue: 1,3:03:08.11,3:03:11.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Men. You heard what he said?
Dialogue: 2,3:03:15.91,3:03:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来放哨。你们都睡吧。
Dialogue: 1,3:03:15.91,3:03:20.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll keep lookout. All of you, sleep.
Dialogue: 2,3:03:21.79,3:03:27.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，万藏，你先回家。
Dialogue: 1,3:03:21.79,3:03:27.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Also, Manzo. You go home first.
Dialogue: 2,3:03:28.29,3:03:33.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好看看你女儿……你儿子的脸。
Dialogue: 1,3:03:28.29,3:03:33.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take a good look at your daughter's. . . your son's face.
Dialogue: 2,3:03:42.64,3:03:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}命令我传到了。
Dialogue: 1,3:03:42.64,3:03:44.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I relayed orders.
Dialogue: 2,3:03:44.27,3:03:46.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了。你也歇着吧。
Dialogue: 1,3:03:44.27,3:03:46.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's enough. You rest too. 21384
Dialogue: 2,3:03:50.44,3:03:52.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，胜四郎。
Dialogue: 1,3:03:50.44,3:03:52.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Katsushiro.
Dialogue: 2,3:03:53.70,3:03:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,3:03:53.70,3:03:55.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is Kikuchiyo?
Dialogue: 2,3:03:55.45,3:03:58.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}果然，在坟边。
Dialogue: 1,3:03:55.45,3:03:58.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}As expected, beside the graves.
Dialogue: 2,3:03:58.82,3:04:00.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道了。
Dialogue: 1,3:03:58.82,3:04:00.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well.
Dialogue: 2,3:05:13.40,3:05:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天，咱们都得死！
Dialogue: 1,3:05:13.40,3:05:16.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomorrow, we're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 2,3:05:16.15,3:05:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这么说……也许不会。我只是……
Dialogue: 1,3:05:16.15,3:05:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't say that. . . We might not. I just. . .
Dialogue: 2,3:05:20.28,3:05:23.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可也有可能啊！
Dialogue: 1,3:05:20.28,3:05:23.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But there's a chance we might!
Dialogue: 2,3:05:25.04,3:05:26.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……
Dialogue: 1,3:05:25.04,3:05:26.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's...
Dialogue: 2,3:05:44.89,3:05:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！我志乃呢？！
Dialogue: 1,3:05:44.89,3:05:48.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino! Where's my Shino? !
Dialogue: 2,3:05:51.77,3:05:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！我志乃呢？！
Dialogue: 1,3:05:51.77,3:05:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino! Where's my Shino? ! 21393
Dialogue: 2,3:05:56.82,3:05:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！志乃！
Dialogue: 1,3:05:56.82,3:05:59.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino!
Dialogue: 2,3:06:30.48,3:06:33.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒？哪儿弄来的？
Dialogue: 1,3:06:30.48,3:06:33.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sake? Where did you find that?
Dialogue: 2,3:06:48.37,3:06:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来如此。跟菊千代说的一样，他们什么都有。
Dialogue: 1,3:06:48.37,3:06:53.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I see. Just as Kikuchiyo said. They have everything.
Dialogue: 2,3:07:03.26,3:07:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，这个我收下。
Dialogue: 1,3:07:03.26,3:07:05.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Alright, I shall take this.
Dialogue: 2,3:07:09.39,3:07:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！
Dialogue: 1,3:07:09.39,3:07:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino!21398
Dialogue: 2,3:07:12.89,3:07:14.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！
Dialogue: 1,3:07:12.89,3:07:14.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino!31398
Dialogue: 2,3:07:25.41,3:07:26.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！
Dialogue: 1,3:07:25.41,3:07:26.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino!
Dialogue: 2,3:07:36.75,3:07:40.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒。喝点，歇着吧。
Dialogue: 1,3:07:36.75,3:07:40.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sake. Drink some and rest. 21399
Dialogue: 2,3:07:41.00,3:07:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。
Dialogue: 1,3:07:41.00,3:07:42.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 2,3:07:45.05,3:07:49.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不像你。明天得灵活点。
Dialogue: 1,3:07:45.05,3:07:49.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is unlike you. You'll need to be nimble tomorrow. 21401
Dialogue: 2,3:08:00.82,3:08:03.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！志乃！
Dialogue: 1,3:08:00.82,3:08:03.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino! 31401
Dialogue: 2,3:08:56.25,3:08:57.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}志乃！
Dialogue: 1,3:08:56.25,3:08:57.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shino!
Dialogue: 2,3:09:08.26,3:09:09.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这小丫头！
Dialogue: 1,3:09:08.26,3:09:09.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You little brat!
Dialogue: 2,3:09:26.53,3:09:28.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！别这么粗鲁！
Dialogue: 1,3:09:26.53,3:09:28.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! Don't be so rough!
Dialogue: 2,3:09:28.78,3:09:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个农家女和武士……你怎么能这样？！
Dialogue: 1,3:09:28.78,3:09:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A peasant girl and a samurai. . . How could you? !
Dialogue: 2,3:09:58.68,3:10:00.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这贱人……
Dialogue: 1,3:09:58.68,3:10:00.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You slut. . .
Dialogue: 2,3:10:10.45,3:10:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万藏。她是你女儿？
Dialogue: 1,3:10:10.45,3:10:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Manzo. Is she your daughter?
Dialogue: 2,3:10:21.83,3:10:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说清楚。你说“武士”，那武士是谁？
Dialogue: 1,3:10:21.83,3:10:27.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Explain yourself. You said "samurai. " Who is that samurai? 21413
Dialogue: 2,3:10:29.84,3:10:31.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万藏！
Dialogue: 1,3:10:29.84,3:10:31.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Manzo!
Dialogue: 2,3:10:41.06,3:10:45.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万藏，说话呀。你为什么不吭声？！
Dialogue: 1,3:10:41.06,3:10:45.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Manzo, speak up. Why won't you? !
Dialogue: 2,3:11:18.01,3:11:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫志乃，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,3:11:18.01,3:11:20.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Your name is Shino, yes?
Dialogue: 2,3:11:39.28,3:11:42.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万藏，别这么冲她发火。
Dialogue: 1,3:11:39.28,3:11:42.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Manzo. Don't be so mad at her.
Dialogue: 2,3:11:43.92,3:11:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼看死神就在跟前，
Dialogue: 1,3:11:43.92,3:11:46.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}When death's around the corner,
Dialogue: 2,3:11:47.04,3:11:50.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人总得找个出口，才能撑下去。
Dialogue: 1,3:11:47.04,3:11:50.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}we have to act out so we can get by.
Dialogue: 2,3:11:56.26,3:11:58.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大战前夜，
Dialogue: 1,3:11:56.26,3:11:58.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}On nights before battles,
Dialogue: 2,3:12:00.43,3:12:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}城里也常有这种事。
Dialogue: 1,3:12:00.43,3:12:02.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}such things happen in castles.
Dialogue: 2,3:12:06.02,3:12:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想想你年轻的时候。他们也是情不自禁。
Dialogue: 1,3:12:06.02,3:12:09.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember your youth. They couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 2,3:12:11.07,3:12:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也不能这么干！我唯一的女儿就这么毁了！
Dialogue: 1,3:12:11.07,3:12:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That don't make it right! My only daughter's damaged goods!
Dialogue: 2,3:12:31.09,3:12:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是爱情！别抱怨了！
Dialogue: 1,3:12:31.09,3:12:33.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's love! Quit complaining!
Dialogue: 2,3:12:33.42,3:12:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她又不是被送给山贼了！
Dialogue: 1,3:12:33.42,3:12:35.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She wasn't given to bandits!
Dialogue: 2,3:14:08.31,3:14:12.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们都吓僵了。得活动活动筋骨。
Dialogue: 1,3:14:08.31,3:14:12.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They look petrified. They need limbering up.
Dialogue: 2,3:14:20.65,3:14:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大伙儿，决战到了。
Dialogue: 1,3:14:20.65,3:14:23.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Men, our showdown is upon us.
Dialogue: 2,3:14:26.83,3:14:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎，今天你可得卖力。
Dialogue: 1,3:14:26.83,3:14:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro, you'd better pull your weight today.
Dialogue: 2,3:14:32.96,3:14:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从昨晚起，你就是个男人了。
Dialogue: 1,3:14:32.96,3:14:35.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Since last night, you're a man.
Dialogue: 2,3:14:53.98,3:14:55.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！
Dialogue: 1,3:14:53.98,3:14:55.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 2,3:14:58.57,3:15:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！打起精神来！
Dialogue: 1,3:14:58.57,3:15:01.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Show some spirit!
Dialogue: 2,3:15:03.45,3:15:06.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}苦着脸，怎么能打赢！
Dialogue: 1,3:15:03.45,3:15:06.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}With those long faces, you'll never win!
Dialogue: 2,3:15:20.51,3:15:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代。那干什么用？
Dialogue: 1,3:15:20.51,3:15:22.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo. What's that for? 21437
Dialogue: 2,3:15:22.88,3:15:25.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一把刀杀不了五个！
Dialogue: 1,3:15:22.88,3:15:25.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}One sword can't kill five!
Dialogue: 2,3:15:40.86,3:15:42.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还剩十三个山贼！
Dialogue: 1,3:15:40.86,3:15:42.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}13 bandits left!
Dialogue: 2,3:15:44.03,3:15:47.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他们全放进村子！
Dialogue: 1,3:15:44.03,3:15:47.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We shall let them all into the village!
Dialogue: 2,3:15:49.54,3:15:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等他们过去，我们就追，在路口把他们围住！
Dialogue: 1,3:15:49.54,3:15:56.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}When they pass by, we'll give chase and hem them in at the crossing!
Dialogue: 2,3:15:59.30,3:16:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}此战胜负……就看这一招！
Dialogue: 1,3:15:59.30,3:16:03.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our victory. . . depends on this gambit!
Dialogue: 2,3:16:33.66,3:16:35.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！他们来了！
Dialogue: 1,3:16:33.66,3:16:35.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! Here they come!
Dialogue: 2,3:16:59.10,3:17:00.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！他们来了！
Dialogue: 1,3:16:59.10,3:17:00.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! They're here!
Dialogue: 2,3:17:25.84,3:17:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}七郎次、胜四郎，去西边！久藏、菊千代，东边！
Dialogue: 1,3:17:25.84,3:17:30.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shichiroji, Katsushiro, go west! Kyuzo, Kikuchiyo, east! 21446
Dialogue: 2,3:17:35.35,3:17:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}掉头！掉头！
Dialogue: 1,3:17:35.35,3:17:38.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}About-turn! 31446
Dialogue: 2,3:18:04.80,3:18:06.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}掉头！
Dialogue: 1,3:18:04.80,3:18:06.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}About-turn!
Dialogue: 2,3:19:11.57,3:19:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎！利吉！胜四郎！
Dialogue: 1,3:19:11.57,3:19:14.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro! Rikichi!
Dialogue: 2,3:19:15.49,3:19:17.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}东边！去东边！
Dialogue: 1,3:19:15.49,3:19:17.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}East! Go east!
Dialogue: 2,3:19:18.12,3:19:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}东边！
Dialogue: 1,3:19:18.12,3:19:19.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}East!
Dialogue: 2,3:19:36.97,3:19:38.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别出声！
Dialogue: 1,3:19:36.97,3:19:38.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't make a sound!
Dialogue: 2,3:19:39.14,3:19:41.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然就杀了你！
Dialogue: 1,3:19:39.14,3:19:41.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Or we'll kill you!
Dialogue: 2,3:20:28.81,3:20:30.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！干掉一个！
Dialogue: 1,3:20:28.81,3:20:30.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good! Got him!
Dialogue: 2,3:20:30.19,3:20:31.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干掉他了！
Dialogue: 1,3:20:30.19,3:20:31.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We got his ass!
Dialogue: 2,3:20:32.57,3:20:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！去东边！东边！
Dialogue: 1,3:20:32.57,3:20:34.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Go east! East!
Dialogue: 2,3:20:49.84,3:20:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜四郎！撤退！撤退！
Dialogue: 1,3:20:49.84,3:20:52.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Katsushiro! Retreat!
Dialogue: 2,3:20:54.59,3:20:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这混蛋！去你的！
Dialogue: 1,3:20:54.59,3:20:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You bastard! Screw you!
Dialogue: 2,3:20:58.59,3:21:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代！菊千代！
Dialogue: 1,3:20:58.59,3:21:00.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo! 21458
Dialogue: 2,3:21:36.38,3:21:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菊千代！菊千代！菊千代！
Dialogue: 1,3:21:36.38,3:21:39.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kikuchiyo!
Dialogue: 2,3:21:49.10,3:21:51.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山贼！在哪儿？！在哪儿？！
Dialogue: 1,3:21:49.10,3:21:51.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bandits! Where are they? ! Where? !
Dialogue: 2,3:21:51.90,3:21:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个不剩了！
Dialogue: 1,3:21:51.90,3:21:53.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They are no more!
Dialogue: 2,3:22:12.54,3:22:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们又活下来了……
Dialogue: 1,3:22:12.54,3:22:15.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yet again, we've survived. . .
Dialogue: 2,3:25:53.60,3:25:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又打了一场败仗。
Dialogue: 1,3:25:53.60,3:25:57.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Once more, we fought a losing battle.
Dialogue: 2,3:26:00.27,3:26:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说到底，赢的是那些农民。
Dialogue: 1,3:26:00.27,3:26:04.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}After all, the winners are those peasants.
Dialogue: 2,3:26:06.11,3:26:07.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是我们。
Dialogue: 1,3:26:06.11,3:26:07.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Not us.
Dialogue: 2,3:26:37.56,3:26:42.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}七武士
Dialogue: 1,3:26:37.56,3:26:42.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}SEVEN SAMURAI
Dialogue: 2,3:26:42.31,3:26:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剧终
Dialogue: 1,3:26:42.31,3:26:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The End
